(1525413, 200826, 38793, '<td valign="top">Ha...this photo is fun, it doesn''t show the idea of family in a conventional way.  Nice creativity, good idea, photo is decent so Ill give you a 9 because I like the creativity.</td>', 'Ha...this photo is fun, it doesn''t show the idea of family in a conventional way.  Nice creativity, good idea, photo is decent so Ill give you a 9 because I like the creativity.', '2005-07-11 03:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525415, 200964, 37252, '<td valign="top">the waters here look "muddy" - try shooting scenes like this when the sun is casted across the water for a more dramatic effect. Remember - light and shadows are what we capture to make great shots - not just a worthy subject</td>', 'the waters here look "muddy" - try shooting scenes like this when the sun is casted across the water for a more dramatic effect. Remember - light and shadows are what we capture to make great shots - not just a worthy subject', '2005-07-11 03:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525416, 202375, 36619, '<td valign="top">for me, this is reaching a bit too far away from any traditional meaning of family. i really did try to understand the reasoning behind it from many perspectives. sorry.</td>', 'for me, this is reaching a bit too far away from any traditional meaning of family. i really did try to understand the reasoning behind it from many perspectives. sorry.', '2005-07-11 03:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
