(1525419, 202404, 37252, '<td valign="top">angled a little too much in my opinion. The sentiment of loss of family would have been portrayed better if the stone were not from generations so far removed (stone reads 1868-1904). The deceased and the young person would not have any ties other than a distant relative they never met.</td>', 'angled a little too much in my opinion. The sentiment of loss of family would have been portrayed better if the stone were not from generations so far removed (stone reads 1868-1904). The deceased and the young person would not have any ties other than a distant relative they never met.', '2005-07-11 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
