(1525499, 202327, 37252, '<td valign="top">the shoes say they belong to a family...now, think of something the family might do together....walk down a street, play in a stream, ??? whatever ....perhaps if you had the shoes playing out that scene it would be more interesting. Try it...then let me know if you agree.</td>', 'the shoes say they belong to a family...now, think of something the family might do together....walk down a street, play in a stream, ??? whatever ....perhaps if you had the shoes playing out that scene it would be more interesting. Try it...then let me know if you agree.', '2005-07-11 04:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525500, 201612, 37252, '<td valign="top">other than the hand being too oof , I really like your photo.  I like the looks on their faces, the color cast, and the togetherness of father and son conveyed here.</td>', 'other than the hand being too oof , I really like your photo.  I like the looks on their faces, the color cast, and the togetherness of father and son conveyed here.', '2005-07-11 04:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525501, 202334, 36619, '<td valign="top">awww. this is beautiful and happy, and endearing. maybe a little closer cropping of the upper &amp; right would have improved it, but there isn''t much about it that needs to be better. good job!</td>', 'awww. this is beautiful and happy, and endearing. maybe a little closer cropping of the upper & right would have improved it, but there isn''t much about it that needs to be better. good job!', '2005-07-11 04:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525502, 201360, 37252, '<td valign="top">focus is too soft and colors too faded</td>', 'focus is too soft and colors too faded', '2005-07-11 04:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525503, 202502, 93, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little motion blur here. You might want to think about upping the shutter speed (which would have helped with the over-exposure problems as well).  Despite the flaws, it''s a very touching candid portraiture.</td>', 'Looks like a little motion blur here. You might want to think about upping the shutter speed (which would have helped with the over-exposure problems as well).  Despite the flaws, it''s a very touching candid portraiture.', '2005-07-11 04:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
