(1525522, 202159, 37252, '<td valign="top">great DOF. Colors are vibrant and yet you still feel a sense of calm amongst the buffalo.</td>', 'great DOF. Colors are vibrant and yet you still feel a sense of calm amongst the buffalo.', '2005-07-11 04:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525525, 202373, 37252, '<td valign="top">the light casting acorss her hair more would have been nice</td>', 'the light casting acorss her hair more would have been nice', '2005-07-11 04:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525527, 202392, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice photo but does not move me - maybe if the family members were positioned differently?</td>', 'nice photo but does not move me - maybe if the family members were positioned differently?', '2005-07-11 04:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525529, 202488, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot.  I love the T-shirts and backward caps.  Background all right with no distractions.  The only thing that I would change is the reddness in the faces.  I get this too when I take people pictures in lower light.  There might be a better way to do it, but in post-processing, I usually just de-saturate the red channel just a little so my subjects don''t look sunburned.</td>', 'Very cute shot.  I love the T-shirts and backward caps.  Background all right with no distractions.  The only thing that I would change is the reddness in the faces.  I get this too when I take people pictures in lower light.  There might be a better way to do it, but in post-processing, I usually just de-saturate the red channel just a little so my subjects don''t look sunburned.', '2005-07-11 04:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525530, 201982, 37252, '<td valign="top">beautiful phot of ships, yet it does not say family to me...might to you though if you were raised in a family of boat loveers or around the ships. I''m not pointing you down for it, just letting you know what it does or doesn''t say to me.</td>', 'beautiful phot of ships, yet it does not say family to me...might to you though if you were raised in a family of boat loveers or around the ships. I''m not pointing you down for it, just letting you know what it does or doesn''t say to me.', '2005-07-11 04:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
