(1525761, 201983, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Her eyes seem a little dull.  Perhaps sharpening them a little and dodging her white just a hair to make them stand out from her hair.  Maybe even crop out the background so that it is just her and the foreground, no distractions.  Just a few thoughts.  But I love her expression, no cheesy smile, just her.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Her eyes seem a little dull.  Perhaps sharpening them a little and dodging her white just a hair to make them stand out from her hair.  Maybe even crop out the background so that it is just her and the foreground, no distractions.  Just a few thoughts.  But I love her expression, no cheesy smile, just her.', '2005-07-11 07:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
