(1525764, 202169, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w.</td>', 'Nice b/w.', '2005-07-11 07:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525765, 202462, 36499, '<td valign="top">Hey i grew up 45 minutes from there in delaware! its changed alot. ok...now on to my real comment:<br/>fo me this photo would have been better for family if u had zoomed in a little more to the father and daughter feeding the birds. I know that O.C. is a family "hot spot" but most voters dont even know where it is. there is great colors and dof is perfect for me. a definate "meets the challenge" for me...good luck 7</td>', 'Hey i grew up 45 minutes from there in delaware! its changed alot. ok...now on to my real comment:fo me this photo would have been better for family if u had zoomed in a little more to the father and daughter feeding the birds. I know that O.C. is a family "hot spot" but most voters dont even know where it is. there is great colors and dof is perfect for me. a definate "meets the challenge" for me...good luck 7', '2005-07-11 07:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525766, 201668, 34906, '<td valign="top">Really conveys the messiness of family life.  Although the technique is a bit off, this concept really speaks to me in many ways.  Says it all!</td>', 'Really conveys the messiness of family life.  Although the technique is a bit off, this concept really speaks to me in many ways.  Says it all!', '2005-07-11 07:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525767, 201772, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is sooo off the wall that I am almost tempted to give it 10 for the cheek of it. But I won''t.<br/> <br/>It is such a tangled mess that the photo has no real subject. It also seems to be a bit over-exposed.</td>', 'This is sooo off the wall that I am almost tempted to give it 10 for the cheek of it. But I won''t. It is such a tangled mess that the photo has no real subject. It also seems to be a bit over-exposed.', '2005-07-11 07:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525768, 202460, 31230, '<td valign="top">How sweet.  Love those eyes and that hair.  Wow.  Not sure what that is in the foreground on the right (a step maybe), but maybe if you had zoomed in and cropped tighter on them, maybe even portrait not landscape, you could have gotten rid of that and still had a great image.</td>', 'How sweet.  Love those eyes and that hair.  Wow.  Not sure what that is in the foreground on the right (a step maybe), but maybe if you had zoomed in and cropped tighter on them, maybe even portrait not landscape, you could have gotten rid of that and still had a great image.', '2005-07-11 07:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
