(1525794, 200213, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with lovely open sky. I like the semi-silhouette nature of the people. The cloud is distracting to me in terms of composition but the image is still a strong one.</td>', 'Beautiful image with lovely open sky. I like the semi-silhouette nature of the people. The cloud is distracting to me in terms of composition but the image is still a strong one.', '2005-07-11 08:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525795, 201459, 36499, '<td valign="top">if you put two girls there u will have my family! I sooo connect with this photo. lovely photo here</td>', 'if you put two girls there u will have my family! I sooo connect with this photo. lovely photo here', '2005-07-11 08:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525796, 200267, 34906, '<td valign="top">Tell me about it.  The expression on the figure on the left is out of place for me in this composition.  I don''t know, the image gets me to thinking.  Is it meant to show the variety of feelings of the characters toward the main character.  Is there supposed to be a special bond between the subject on the left and the character?  How do you interpret it?</td>', 'Tell me about it.  The expression on the figure on the left is out of place for me in this composition.  I don''t know, the image gets me to thinking.  Is it meant to show the variety of feelings of the characters toward the main character.  Is there supposed to be a special bond between the subject on the left and the character?  How do you interpret it?', '2005-07-11 08:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525797, 201668, 3087, '<td valign="top">ROFL! Yep that looks like a real family home. Ignoring the question of whether I even want to think about the model doing his business the framing of the walls and clutter is actually really strong and there is (thankfully) so much other than the obvious to look at - the letters and numbers on the tiles, the toys, the laundry and so on. Nice one!</td>', 'ROFL! Yep that looks like a real family home. Ignoring the question of whether I even want to think about the model doing his business the framing of the walls and clutter is actually really strong and there is (thankfully) so much other than the obvious to look at - the letters and numbers on the tiles, the toys, the laundry and so on. Nice one!', '2005-07-11 08:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525798, 202316, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but let down for me by the harsh lighting, over exposure and overly pink colour cast.</td>', 'Interesting idea but let down for me by the harsh lighting, over exposure and overly pink colour cast.', '2005-07-11 08:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525799, 202151, 36499, '<td valign="top">i like the family portrait here and the arrangement is great. but...(theres always a but) the shadows behind everyone is a major distraction for me.</td>', 'i like the family portrait here and the arrangement is great. but...(theres always a but) the shadows behind everyone is a major distraction for me.', '2005-07-11 08:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525800, 202447, 3087, '<td valign="top">Particularly dislike the border with that strange white faded internal edge and it really distracts from my ability to enjoy the photograph itself which I actually quite like - an interesting and unusual study of an every day scene.</td>', 'Particularly dislike the border with that strange white faded internal edge and it really distracts from my ability to enjoy the photograph itself which I actually quite like - an interesting and unusual study of an every day scene.', '2005-07-11 08:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525801, 202289, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely compositional tool - the lines of the water and they add a great partial frame whilst also being a key part of the subject matter. This perhaps speaks more to me of "childhood" than "family" as an evident theme but it''s all down to personal interpretation. Nicely done!</td>', 'Lovely compositional tool - the lines of the water and they add a great partial frame whilst also being a key part of the subject matter. This perhaps speaks more to me of "childhood" than "family" as an evident theme but it''s all down to personal interpretation. Nicely done!', '2005-07-11 08:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1525803, 202256, 3087, '<td valign="top">A sweet scene that is universal enough to remind many of our childhoods in the bosom of our families - many entries don''t have what I''d term universal appeal - this one does I think.</td>', 'A sweet scene that is universal enough to remind many of our childhoods in the bosom of our families - many entries don''t have what I''d term universal appeal - this one does I think.', '2005-07-11 08:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
