(1526068, 200763, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the feet!!! That''s really a cute shot. Those blue eyes are gorgeous.  On 3nd review, I might suggest cropping the sleeping kiddo on the right since you can''t see him/her anyway and you wouldn''t lose those darling feet.  I''m sticking to my 7 vote though.</td>', 'I love the feet!!! That''s really a cute shot. Those blue eyes are gorgeous.  On 3nd review, I might suggest cropping the sleeping kiddo on the right since you can''t see him/her anyway and you wouldn''t lose those darling feet.  I''m sticking to my 7 vote though.', '2005-07-11 09:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526071, 201515, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Nice natural capture. Love the variations of color. The umbrella is a nice touch.  On second review, I might crop out the shoes, as they are so bright, it brings your eye down and away from their pretty faces. I think that the shirt and the purse match is more complimentary to the entire shot.  I''m still saying 7 though - it''s good.</td>', 'Very cute. Nice natural capture. Love the variations of color. The umbrella is a nice touch.  On second review, I might crop out the shoes, as they are so bright, it brings your eye down and away from their pretty faces. I think that the shirt and the purse match is more complimentary to the entire shot.  I''m still saying 7 though - it''s good.', '2005-07-11 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526073, 202298, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d crop out the lower third. The contrast seems a touch severe but the overall image is nice.</td>', 'I''d crop out the lower third. The contrast seems a touch severe but the overall image is nice.', '2005-07-11 09:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526074, 202353, 15711, '<td valign="top">CLEVER. Well done.  On 2nd review, I''m appreciating this more. I just realized that you can see the filaments in the 3 clear bulbs and the other one looks like the "dad."  That is very imaginative and smart. 8</td>', 'CLEVER. Well done.  On 2nd review, I''m appreciating this more. I just realized that you can see the filaments in the 3 clear bulbs and the other one looks like the "dad."  That is very imaginative and smart. 8', '2005-07-11 09:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
