(1526104, 202193, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a bit busy.  I had to study it to figure out that those were goslings. But once I got that and read the title - I got a bit of a chuckle. The water is a tad  harsh and detracts from the nice tones of the birds.  I wish the babies necks and faces weren''t so dark.</td>', 'This is a bit busy.  I had to study it to figure out that those were goslings. But once I got that and read the title - I got a bit of a chuckle. The water is a tad  harsh and detracts from the nice tones of the birds.  I wish the babies necks and faces weren''t so dark.', '2005-07-11 10:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
