(1526107, 202210, 39664, '<td valign="top">I reminds me of a time my in-laws brought my daughter home on Easter Sunday.  I could read her lips through the glass of the car screaming "I got BUNNIES!!!"  The nice man on the side of the road told my in-laws that the babies were too young to leave Momma but he would make them a "deal" to take them all!  Yeah, right!  Mom and 7 babies.  What a mess!<br/> <br/>Anyhoo, back to your photo, very cute subject, nice out of the box thinking....they could be family and family and family!</td>', 'I reminds me of a time my in-laws brought my daughter home on Easter Sunday.  I could read her lips through the glass of the car screaming "I got BUNNIES!!!"  The nice man on the side of the road told my in-laws that the babies were too young to leave Momma but he would make them a "deal" to take them all!  Yeah, right!  Mom and 7 babies.  What a mess! Anyhoo, back to your photo, very cute subject, nice out of the box thinking....they could be family and family and family!', '2005-07-11 10:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526110, 201541, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle from overhead. The blue of the water in contrast with the other shades in the photo is appealing and takes your eye to take in the entire shot. It dosen''t focus on one thing, but it''s not too busy. The "line" of people is a good aspect to this shot as well. It could use a touch more focus for my eye.</td>', 'Interesting angle from overhead. The blue of the water in contrast with the other shades in the photo is appealing and takes your eye to take in the entire shot. It dosen''t focus on one thing, but it''s not too busy. The "line" of people is a good aspect to this shot as well. It could use a touch more focus for my eye.', '2005-07-11 10:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
