(1526212, 200763, 15266, '<td valign="top">Cute kid (the one who can actually be seen in this shot).  The side of his face is quite blown, also the child who''s head is cut off by this shot was not a good compositional choice. Cropping to just show the feet and the boy on the left would have worked better imo.</td>', 'Cute kid (the one who can actually be seen in this shot).  The side of his face is quite blown, also the child who''s head is cut off by this shot was not a good compositional choice. Cropping to just show the feet and the boy on the left would have worked better imo.', '2005-07-11 10:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526214, 202169, 15266, '<td valign="top">Lovely b/w portrait.  The bright sunlight here was handled well.</td>', 'Lovely b/w portrait.  The bright sunlight here was handled well.', '2005-07-11 10:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526215, 202198, 35804, '<td valign="top">Completely charming...the B &amp; W is so very nice...the skin is so alive...it''s so nice to see some skin that actually looks real and hasn''t been neat imaged and diffused to death...I also love what the title implies...a little wink and a smile...this is so about love and closeness..nicely done and here''s to hoping this does very well.</td>', 'Completely charming...the B & W is so very nice...the skin is so alive...it''s so nice to see some skin that actually looks real and hasn''t been neat imaged and diffused to death...I also love what the title implies...a little wink and a smile...this is so about love and closeness..nicely done and here''s to hoping this does very well.', '2005-07-11 10:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526216, 201625, 15266, '<td valign="top">Aweeeeeee they''re so cute!   I wish the DOF were a bit deeper here so that all 4 ducks were in focus.  Also the shot is a touch overexposed causing hot spots, especially on the ducky on the right.</td>', 'Aweeeeeee they''re so cute!   I wish the DOF were a bit deeper here so that all 4 ducks were in focus.  Also the shot is a touch overexposed causing hot spots, especially on the ducky on the right.', '2005-07-11 10:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
