(1526228, 202316, 37719, '<td valign="top">Is your title an indication of the score you expect to receive or the fact that the woman is pregnant?  I find this somewhat offensive - naked children as well as the rest of the family being naked.  It could have been done without the nudity.  The processing makes it hard to look at as well - a lot of glare or reflection that hurts the eyes.</td>', 'Is your title an indication of the score you expect to receive or the fact that the woman is pregnant?  I find this somewhat offensive - naked children as well as the rest of the family being naked.  It could have been done without the nudity.  The processing makes it hard to look at as well - a lot of glare or reflection that hurts the eyes.', '2005-07-11 11:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
