(1526234, 201690, 37719, '<td valign="top">Honestly, there is nothing here to tell me they are sisters.  It could be any two girls that modeled for the shot.  Also, if I am not smart enough to figure out that ''siblings'' means they are supposed to be sisters, you telling me ''sisters'' in the title insults my intelligence.</td>', 'Honestly, there is nothing here to tell me they are sisters.  It could be any two girls that modeled for the shot.  Also, if I am not smart enough to figure out that ''siblings'' means they are supposed to be sisters, you telling me ''sisters'' in the title insults my intelligence.', '2005-07-11 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526237, 202469, 37719, '<td valign="top">The processing on this shot makes it very hard to look at.  Way too bright and washed out looking.  There is nothing in the shot to tell me they are ''exposing'' anything, certainly not love, as well as nothing in the shot to me that indicates family.</td>', 'The processing on this shot makes it very hard to look at.  Way too bright and washed out looking.  There is nothing in the shot to tell me they are ''exposing'' anything, certainly not love, as well as nothing in the shot to me that indicates family.', '2005-07-11 11:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526243, 201652, 37719, '<td valign="top">A nice shot of some kids (any adults??) on a balcony/deck/life guard chair somewhere.  Nothing to me indicates family.  It could be any group of people randomly shot.</td>', 'A nice shot of some kids (any adults??) on a balcony/deck/life guard chair somewhere.  Nothing to me indicates family.  It could be any group of people randomly shot.', '2005-07-11 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526254, 202357, 15711, '<td valign="top">Clever title. Interesting perspective on Family - I like originality. Nicely studio  photo. The shadow on the floor is a nice touch.</td>', 'Clever title. Interesting perspective on Family - I like originality. Nicely studio  photo. The shadow on the floor is a nice touch.', '2005-07-11 11:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
