(1526267, 202347, 15711, '<td valign="top">Their bodies seem elongated from top to bottom. Maybe it''s just me. Great overall capture of them - nice and natural.  I''m going to elaborate on this one. The composition is well shot but the lighting is a tad dim and there isn''t any POW factor on their faces. The varying heights is good, but overall, it could use some tweaking. Hope this helps.</td>', 'Their bodies seem elongated from top to bottom. Maybe it''s just me. Great overall capture of them - nice and natural.  I''m going to elaborate on this one. The composition is well shot but the lighting is a tad dim and there isn''t any POW factor on their faces. The varying heights is good, but overall, it could use some tweaking. Hope this helps.', '2005-07-11 11:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526270, 201369, 15711, '<td valign="top">This just seems too staged.  Maybe if the pieces of paper weren''t in such perfect symmetry, it might be a bit more interesting.  Or perhaps if it were shot from a side view and not just straight on. The rose is a tad blurred. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'This just seems too staged.  Maybe if the pieces of paper weren''t in such perfect symmetry, it might be a bit more interesting.  Or perhaps if it were shot from a side view and not just straight on. The rose is a tad blurred. Hope this is helpful.', '2005-07-11 11:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
