(1526288, 200763, 37719, '<td valign="top">I hope you didn''t have to listen to "Are we there yet?" too much.  I think this is one of the better shots representing ''family'' in the challenge.  The washed out windows don''t even bother me too much as there is enough going on to keep your attention.  Nice job!  Good luck!</td>', 'I hope you didn''t have to listen to "Are we there yet?" too much.  I think this is one of the better shots representing ''family'' in the challenge.  The washed out windows don''t even bother me too much as there is enough going on to keep your attention.  Nice job!  Good luck!', '2005-07-11 11:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526291, 200291, 37719, '<td valign="top">See, now this, even with only two people in the shot, instantly made me think of family and all the picnics we had in my younger years.  Granpa always did the cooking.  I like that you focused on one main subject.  Well composed.  Could be a little brigter in some areas, but overall, nice job for the challenge!</td>', 'See, now this, even with only two people in the shot, instantly made me think of family and all the picnics we had in my younger years.  Granpa always did the cooking.  I like that you focused on one main subject.  Well composed.  Could be a little brigter in some areas, but overall, nice job for the challenge!', '2005-07-11 11:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526294, 202488, 37719, '<td valign="top">This is scary - I hope they don''t go out in public like that!  Good shot.  well composed and focused.  I like the ''unbusy'' background.  Lets them stand out as the only focal point with no distractions.  Nice job!</td>', 'This is scary - I hope they don''t go out in public like that!  Good shot.  well composed and focused.  I like the ''unbusy'' background.  Lets them stand out as the only focal point with no distractions.  Nice job!', '2005-07-11 11:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526296, 202076, 15266, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is harsh, causing the image to seem flat.  A bump in contrast would help a bit.  Also, another choice of composition to remove distracting items from the frame would have made a better image (house in bg).</td>', 'The lighting here is harsh, causing the image to seem flat.  A bump in contrast would help a bit.  Also, another choice of composition to remove distracting items from the frame would have made a better image (house in bg).', '2005-07-11 11:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
