(1526740, 202056, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good sentiment.  I like the reflection idea, but the double reflection shadows are a bit distracting (IMHO) - the single reflections are fine.  Maybe this was caused by multiple light sources?  Also the highlights are a little overblown.  Still, a very nice shot that I like a lot.  Just my 2 cents...  7</td>', 'Nice shot and good sentiment.  I like the reflection idea, but the double reflection shadows are a bit distracting (IMHO) - the single reflections are fine.  Maybe this was caused by multiple light sources?  Also the highlights are a little overblown.  Still, a very nice shot that I like a lot.  Just my 2 cents...  7', '2005-07-11 13:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526741, 202423, 15266, '<td valign="top">Wonderful low POV.  That''s how birds should be shot!   Sun wasn''t your friend here as its caused hotspots on the duckies.  Overall pleasant image though.</td>', 'Wonderful low POV.  That''s how birds should be shot!   Sun wasn''t your friend here as its caused hotspots on the duckies.  Overall pleasant image though.', '2005-07-11 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
