(1526851, 201842, 34659, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Magnificent colors and DOF.  It may sound weird, but the fact that the farthest mask (blue &amp; gold) isn''t as far behind the previous one as the others are.  To me it is the least sharp and/or interesting (also the only one without a blue highlight surrounding the top of the head), and it seems to call attention to itself with its positioning.  Yes, this is REALLY nitpicking (probably because I can find very little else wrong with the shot.  Great job!  9  Bumping to 10.</td>', 'WOW!  Magnificent colors and DOF.  It may sound weird, but the fact that the farthest mask (blue & gold) isn''t as far behind the previous one as the others are.  To me it is the least sharp and/or interesting (also the only one without a blue highlight surrounding the top of the head), and it seems to call attention to itself with its positioning.  Yes, this is REALLY nitpicking (probably because I can find very little else wrong with the shot.  Great job!  9  Bumping to 10.', '2005-07-11 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526852, 201854, 15266, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but borders on inappropriate as the eye naturally follows the hands. Also it looks like he''s biting or licking her.      The tones and ligthing are excellent, and detail is very crisp. 6</td>', 'Interesting image, but borders on inappropriate as the eye naturally follows the hands. Also it looks like he''s biting or licking her.      The tones and ligthing are excellent, and detail is very crisp. 6', '2005-07-11 13:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
