(1526904, 202334, 37851, '<td valign="top">I love how genuine the affection seems between the girls.  This is beautiful.</td>', 'I love how genuine the affection seems between the girls.  This is beautiful.', '2005-07-11 13:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526907, 202108, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture.  I love orangutans.  Their expressions are great!  Pretty good DOF (although it''s not as sharp as it could be in spots).  Lighting against the back/side wall is a little harsh too, but it''s tough to count off much for this shot.  Nice work!</td>', 'Really nice capture.  I love orangutans.  Their expressions are great!  Pretty good DOF (although it''s not as sharp as it could be in spots).  Lighting against the back/side wall is a little harsh too, but it''s tough to count off much for this shot.  Nice work!', '2005-07-11 13:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526908, 202182, 15266, '<td valign="top">Well captured fruit tree.  I like the tight close composition.   But... family?</td>', 'Well captured fruit tree.  I like the tight close composition.   But... family?', '2005-07-11 13:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526913, 201855, 15266, '<td valign="top">LOL  Love the title.  This is a cute image, but the whites are blown on the birds'' backs.  White birds are very hard to capture in bright sunlight.  You might try exposing for the brightest part of the bird (which will give you a very dark image), then adjusting the levels in PS for a smooth, full-detail image.</td>', 'LOL  Love the title.  This is a cute image, but the whites are blown on the birds'' backs.  White birds are very hard to capture in bright sunlight.  You might try exposing for the brightest part of the bird (which will give you a very dark image), then adjusting the levels in PS for a smooth, full-detail image.', '2005-07-11 13:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526916, 202488, 15266, '<td valign="top">Funny and cute image!  Love the expressions.</td>', 'Funny and cute image!  Love the expressions.', '2005-07-11 13:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526917, 202374, 34659, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...  I think I recognize somebody in this shot.  ;-)<br/> <br/>Nice use of BW - great expressions.  DOF is really good, but seems a little soft around some faces.  (And I can''t see the wrinkles in your neck in this shot! - j/k)<br/> <br/>Great job - it certainly meets the challenge topic well too.  Good luck!  8</td>', 'Hmmm...  I think I recognize somebody in this shot.  ;-) Nice use of BW - great expressions.  DOF is really good, but seems a little soft around some faces.  (And I can''t see the wrinkles in your neck in this shot! - j/k) Great job - it certainly meets the challenge topic well too.  Good luck!  8', '2005-07-11 13:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526918, 202412, 15266, '<td valign="top">I like  the idea here, but would like to see more of the child''s hand, perhaps layed over mommy''s hand.</td>', 'I like  the idea here, but would like to see more of the child''s hand, perhaps layed over mommy''s hand.', '2005-07-11 13:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526922, 202108, 24314, '<td valign="top">love the way the baby is sticking out it''s tongue</td>', 'love the way the baby is sticking out it''s tongue', '2005-07-11 14:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526923, 201652, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool angle and I love the colors.  DOF is a little soft around faces, but otherwise pretty sharp.  Also, the shadows hide some of the expressions (again a very small detail).  Overall, very nice work!</td>', 'Very cool angle and I love the colors.  DOF is a little soft around faces, but otherwise pretty sharp.  Also, the shadows hide some of the expressions (again a very small detail).  Overall, very nice work!', '2005-07-11 14:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526924, 202198, 15266, '<td valign="top">The hands show a lot of detail, gives the feeling of long life and wisdom. But the remote control is a horrible distraction to that feeling. I don''t understand it being included in this composition.</td>', 'The hands show a lot of detail, gives the feeling of long life and wisdom. But the remote control is a horrible distraction to that feeling. I don''t understand it being included in this composition.', '2005-07-11 14:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526927, 201535, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic expressions!  I do with the girl on the right was more in focus, because the girl on the left is superb.  Nice capture.  7</td>', 'Fantastic expressions!  I do with the girl on the right was more in focus, because the girl on the left is superb.  Nice capture.  7', '2005-07-11 14:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526929, 202504, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  I love the soft tones and lighting.  The only think I can say that would possibly improve it (IMHO is to bring out more green in the grasses to contrast with the brown skin tones.  (Pretty insignificant I know...)  Really nice job!  9</td>', 'Very cool shot!  I love the soft tones and lighting.  The only think I can say that would possibly improve it (IMHO is to bring out more green in the grasses to contrast with the brown skin tones.  (Pretty insignificant I know...)  Really nice job!  9', '2005-07-11 14:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526931, 202159, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and great DOF.  The colors are almost surreal though (especially the blue sky), making the tones a little distracting.  Still, a very nice capture and certainly a ribbon contender.  Great job!  9</td>', 'Beautiful shot and great DOF.  The colors are almost surreal though (especially the blue sky), making the tones a little distracting.  Still, a very nice capture and certainly a ribbon contender.  Great job!  9', '2005-07-11 14:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526932, 202261, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture and DOF.  Very emotive and certainly speaks "family".  It''s hard to find much wrong with this shot - really nice composition and I like the muted tones.  Great job.  9</td>', 'Great capture and DOF.  Very emotive and certainly speaks "family".  It''s hard to find much wrong with this shot - really nice composition and I like the muted tones.  Great job.  9', '2005-07-11 14:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526933, 201142, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  My only negative comment would be that the lighting is a little harsh, resulting in some loss of DOF (maybe reducing the backlighting and increasing the contrast just a tad would help?).  Still, I love the tones and composition.  Very well done.  9</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  My only negative comment would be that the lighting is a little harsh, resulting in some loss of DOF (maybe reducing the backlighting and increasing the contrast just a tad would help?).  Still, I love the tones and composition.  Very well done.  9', '2005-07-11 14:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526935, 201625, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful natural colors and great DOF!  By far the best ducky pic.  Really nice job.  9</td>', 'Beautiful natural colors and great DOF!  By far the best ducky pic.  Really nice job.  9', '2005-07-11 14:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526936, 202470, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and blue tones.  There does seem to be a pretty bright glare from the white in the upper left that is a bit distracting (IMHO), but otherwise I think it''s a great shot.  Perfectly meets the challenge.  9</td>', 'Love the composition and blue tones.  There does seem to be a pretty bright glare from the white in the upper left that is a bit distracting (IMHO), but otherwise I think it''s a great shot.  Perfectly meets the challenge.  9', '2005-07-11 14:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526938, 202249, 34659, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  Great job!  My only negative comment would be the DOF on the people is a little poor and the shadows make them less distinguishable (but I realize the distance makes that very tricky).  Beautiful locale and great composition.  Nice work.  9</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  Great job!  My only negative comment would be the DOF on the people is a little poor and the shadows make them less distinguishable (but I realize the distance makes that very tricky).  Beautiful locale and great composition.  Nice work.  9', '2005-07-11 14:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
