(1526940, 201515, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I think it may be cropped a little too tight at the top - I''d like to see all of her head and some more of the umbrella.  The expression is great!  And I really like the colors.  8</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I think it may be cropped a little too tight at the top - I''d like to see all of her head and some more of the umbrella.  The expression is great!  And I really like the colors.  8', '2005-07-11 14:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
