(1526949, 202198, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot &amp; sentiment.  IMHO, it''s a little odd that their hands are over a remote control, but I guess it also adds to the air of a simple, familiar 2nd honeymoon and a lifetime of love.   Great DOF and I like the use of BW.  There is a glare on the bottom of the remote that is a bit distracting, but otherwise I think this is a great shot!  8</td>', 'Beautiful shot & sentiment.  IMHO, it''s a little odd that their hands are over a remote control, but I guess it also adds to the air of a simple, familiar 2nd honeymoon and a lifetime of love.   Great DOF and I like the use of BW.  There is a glare on the bottom of the remote that is a bit distracting, but otherwise I think this is a great shot!  8', '2005-07-11 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526950, 202177, 15266, '<td valign="top">Sweet image, fill-flash would have brought out more detail, but still pleasant overall.</td>', 'Sweet image, fill-flash would have brought out more detail, but still pleasant overall.', '2005-07-11 14:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
