(1526990, 202239, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great setting and beautiful parents. The mom is much clearer with sparcle in her eyes.</td>', 'Great setting and beautiful parents. The mom is much clearer with sparcle in her eyes.', '2005-07-11 14:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526991, 202382, 34659, '<td valign="top">I like what I think you tried to do with this image, and I like the sentiment.  I think it meets the challenge well, but (IMHO) the technical execution could use a little work.  Most images I''ve seen with the blurred kinda "warp speed" effect have a focal point that is very sharply focused.  The cross is not as sharp as I think it needs to be for this effect to work the way you were attempting.  (At least my interpretation of your goal.)  I like the sepia tones and the outer blurred figures are good.  I also really like the composition/crop you chose.  This is one of those images that almost, but not quite, accomplishes a cohesive and well executed approach.  Great try, but I think most voters will probably count off for some of your technically accurate portions as well as those that didn''t quite make it.  Again, I really like what this photo almost is...  Just my 2 cents, so you can throw them out the window if you''d like!  :-)  4</td>', 'I like what I think you tried to do with this image, and I like the sentiment.  I think it meets the challenge well, but (IMHO) the technical execution could use a little work.  Most images I''ve seen with the blurred kinda "warp speed" effect have a focal point that is very sharply focused.  The cross is not as sharp as I think it needs to be for this effect to work the way you were attempting.  (At least my interpretation of your goal.)  I like the sepia tones and the outer blurred figures are good.  I also really like the composition/crop you chose.  This is one of those images that almost, but not quite, accomplishes a cohesive and well executed approach.  Great try, but I think most voters will probably count off for some of your technically accurate portions as well as those that didn''t quite make it.  Again, I really like what this photo almost is...  Just my 2 cents, so you can throw them out the window if you''d like!  :-)  4', '2005-07-11 14:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1526994, 201773, 15266, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, but the whites are totally blown (no detail in the white areas due to overexposure).  The same image shot on a cloudy day or late day would be absolutely magical.</td>', 'Lovely composition, but the whites are totally blown (no detail in the white areas due to overexposure).  The same image shot on a cloudy day or late day would be absolutely magical.', '2005-07-11 14:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
