(1527134, 201823, 37719, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - composition and focus are real nice.  I even like the reflection.  BUT - where is the concept of family?  The fact that they are all peppers?  Sorry, just fell short even for an OOTB shot, IMO.</td>', 'Nice photo - composition and focus are real nice.  I even like the reflection.  BUT - where is the concept of family?  The fact that they are all peppers?  Sorry, just fell short even for an OOTB shot, IMO.', '2005-07-11 15:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527137, 201788, 37719, '<td valign="top">I have viewed this 5 times now.  I still am having trouble relating this to the challenge.  I can see where you wanted to go with your concept, just didn''t do it for me.  Family does not come to mind.  Well composed - yes. Good lighting and creative.  Just not for family IMO.</td>', 'I have viewed this 5 times now.  I still am having trouble relating this to the challenge.  I can see where you wanted to go with your concept, just didn''t do it for me.  Family does not come to mind.  Well composed - yes. Good lighting and creative.  Just not for family IMO.', '2005-07-11 15:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527140, 201666, 25397, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda like a statue or something because of the texture of the hands<br/>Good place to use a tight crop like you did and the black background works</td>', 'Looks kinda like a statue or something because of the texture of the handsGood place to use a tight crop like you did and the black background works', '2005-07-11 15:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527141, 201652, 39145, '<td valign="top">i honestly really like this one because of the fact that it looks like it could be in some teen magazine. The color is really awesome, too!</td>', 'i honestly really like this one because of the fact that it looks like it could be in some teen magazine. The color is really awesome, too!', '2005-07-11 15:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527147, 202439, 37719, '<td valign="top">The shot is fuzzy or unclear - like a shadow is over the whole shot or it has been muted with a cloudy layer of some sort..  You can barely see the people in the carriage so it is hard to tell if this really is their ''Sunday Best'' as they dress similar every day which wouldn''t really matter anyway.  I have not been able to see the concept of family in the shot.</td>', 'The shot is fuzzy or unclear - like a shadow is over the whole shot or it has been muted with a cloudy layer of some sort..  You can barely see the people in the carriage so it is hard to tell if this really is their ''Sunday Best'' as they dress similar every day which wouldn''t really matter anyway.  I have not been able to see the concept of family in the shot.', '2005-07-11 15:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527150, 202375, 25397, '<td valign="top">It makes sence, but there''s nothing particularily special to find in this picture.<br/>If you focussed on shooting the mailboxes themselves, and left out a lot of the stuff around, this could have had a better impact.<br/>A little brightness/contrast could help as well in photoshop</td>', 'It makes sence, but there''s nothing particularily special to find in this picture.If you focussed on shooting the mailboxes themselves, and left out a lot of the stuff around, this could have had a better impact.A little brightness/contrast could help as well in photoshop', '2005-07-11 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527153, 202353, 37719, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  I know, you were trying to be out of the box or some such idea.  But I just don''t get the concept of family from the pic.  Well shot, nice focus, good lighting.</td>', 'I don''t get it.  I know, you were trying to be out of the box or some such idea.  But I just don''t get the concept of family from the pic.  Well shot, nice focus, good lighting.', '2005-07-11 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
