(1527157, 200764, 37719, '<td valign="top">Ok, I give up...what is the connecrtion to family other than the title?  Interesting shot, could have done without the red border.</td>', 'Ok, I give up...what is the connecrtion to family other than the title?  Interesting shot, could have done without the red border.', '2005-07-11 15:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
