(1527166, 202306, 37719, '<td valign="top">What family?  The Sutter family?  Sorry, but a bottle of wine does not convey family to me.  If the photos in the background were your subject I could buy it.  But not the wine bottle - even if your name is Sutter (I don''t know if it is or not).</td>', 'What family?  The Sutter family?  Sorry, but a bottle of wine does not convey family to me.  If the photos in the background were your subject I could buy it.  But not the wine bottle - even if your name is Sutter (I don''t know if it is or not).', '2005-07-11 15:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527170, 201036, 25397, '<td valign="top">I like the glowy-sharpened effect, nice.<br/>I don''t really like the border though, the white is way too thick for me... It distracts from the image, but not my vote. :o)</td>', 'I like the glowy-sharpened effect, nice.I don''t really like the border though, the white is way too thick for me... It distracts from the image, but not my vote. :o)', '2005-07-11 15:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527173, 202391, 25397, '<td valign="top">Strong composition and nice warm tones, great work</td>', 'Strong composition and nice warm tones, great work', '2005-07-11 15:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527174, 201772, 37719, '<td valign="top">What in this picture conveys Family?  It is just a shot of roots.  What conveys Celtic or being ancient?  It is just a shot of roots.  Could have been better focused.  There also is no central point of view in the shot.  I have no idea where to look - I just get lost.</td>', 'What in this picture conveys Family?  It is just a shot of roots.  What conveys Celtic or being ancient?  It is just a shot of roots.  Could have been better focused.  There also is no central point of view in the shot.  I have no idea where to look - I just get lost.', '2005-07-11 15:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527176, 202347, 25397, '<td valign="top">Nice capture<br/>Seems a bit stretched the wrong way?<br/>Trying to make dad look slimmer? ;-)</td>', 'Nice captureSeems a bit stretched the wrong way?Trying to make dad look slimmer? ;-)', '2005-07-11 15:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527183, 202462, 37719, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what is supposed to convey family here.  The people on the beach?  How do we know they are family?  I don''t see anything here that conveys the sense of family to me.  Not even the birds.  The tall grass in front is distracting as well.  I find myself looking at the birds and the grass and not even noticing the beach.</td>', 'I am not sure what is supposed to convey family here.  The people on the beach?  How do we know they are family?  I don''t see anything here that conveys the sense of family to me.  Not even the birds.  The tall grass in front is distracting as well.  I find myself looking at the birds and the grass and not even noticing the beach.', '2005-07-11 15:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527186, 202487, 37719, '<td valign="top">Ok, I give up!  What is the connection to family?  I don''t see it.  Nothing here makes me think of family in the least./  Similar cars does not a family make.,  On the other hand, well focused and great Dof.  Just no family.</td>', 'Ok, I give up!  What is the connection to family?  I don''t see it.  Nothing here makes me think of family in the least./  Similar cars does not a family make.,  On the other hand, well focused and great Dof.  Just no family.', '2005-07-11 15:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527187, 202108, 25397, '<td valign="top">I like the ''flow'' of this picture, as I would call it.  All their hair is sort of flowing to the right, the same directon they''re looking and the same with the crop (the handsome subjects are on the right). It really makes this photo have impact.</td>', 'I like the ''flow'' of this picture, as I would call it.  All their hair is sort of flowing to the right, the same directon they''re looking and the same with the crop (the handsome subjects are on the right). It really makes this photo have impact.', '2005-07-11 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527190, 202379, 37719, '<td valign="top">I see a picture of two children, girls, kissing.  No unconditional love conveyed.  No sense of family conveyed.  Sorry, just as i see it.</td>', 'I see a picture of two children, girls, kissing.  No unconditional love conveyed.  No sense of family conveyed.  Sorry, just as i see it.', '2005-07-11 15:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527191, 202247, 39339, '<td valign="top">just hilarious!  love it!</td>', 'just hilarious!  love it!', '2005-07-11 15:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527193, 202247, 25397, '<td valign="top">aint gunna happen :-p<br/>Neat idea though</td>', 'aint gunna happen :-pNeat idea though', '2005-07-11 15:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527194, 202182, 37719, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t aware that fruit on trees was family.  I can''t even make a rational OOTB connection here.  Nice shot.  Great focus and DoF.  But no family.</td>', 'I wasn''t aware that fruit on trees was family.  I can''t even make a rational OOTB connection here.  Nice shot.  Great focus and DoF.  But no family.', '2005-07-11 15:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527199, 202007, 37719, '<td valign="top">I see two dogs.  What is supposed to convey the sense of family?  Your title?  I like the colors in the shot.  The lighting and focus/clarity are nice as well.  But no feeling of family from it.</td>', 'I see two dogs.  What is supposed to convey the sense of family?  Your title?  I like the colors in the shot.  The lighting and focus/clarity are nice as well.  But no feeling of family from it.', '2005-07-11 15:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527206, 202056, 37719, '<td valign="top">Universal symbol of love and marriage maybe.  But that does not necessarily mean family.  I must be missing something.  it is a nice photo - well focused and lit.  The reflection works nicely.  But I just don''t get family from it.</td>', 'Universal symbol of love and marriage maybe.  But that does not necessarily mean family.  I must be missing something.  it is a nice photo - well focused and lit.  The reflection works nicely.  But I just don''t get family from it.', '2005-07-11 15:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527210, 202316, 25397, '<td valign="top">Great title :-D</td>', 'Great title :-D', '2005-07-11 15:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527217, 201438, 37719, '<td valign="top">Other than your title I get no sense that they are siblings or anything remotely family oriented.  They could be any two kids holding hands by water.  On the other side, it is a nice shot.  The clarity is really good and the b/w works very nicely.</td>', 'Other than your title I get no sense that they are siblings or anything remotely family oriented.  They could be any two kids holding hands by water.  On the other side, it is a nice shot.  The clarity is really good and the b/w works very nicely.', '2005-07-11 15:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527219, 202379, 25397, '<td valign="top">You did it cher!<br/>Awesome work</td>', 'You did it cher!Awesome work', '2005-07-11 15:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527220, 202421, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and feel it is very well done - lighting, focus, clarity, content, composition all very nice!  Well done!</td>', 'I like this shot and feel it is very well done - lighting, focus, clarity, content, composition all very nice!  Well done!', '2005-07-11 15:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527221, 201668, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very creative and very well done!  All too real!  Nice job!</td>', 'Very creative and very well done!  All too real!  Nice job!', '2005-07-11 15:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527225, 201923, 37719, '<td valign="top">Not sure about this shot.  It invokes a sense of poverty and desparation to me - not family other than the title.  Nicely shot - well composed.  Could be a little brighter/a little less processing on the sky.</td>', 'Not sure about this shot.  It invokes a sense of poverty and desparation to me - not family other than the title.  Nicely shot - well composed.  Could be a little brighter/a little less processing on the sky.', '2005-07-11 15:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527233, 200312, 37719, '<td valign="top">I realize it is probably mom, daughter, son(?) BUT I just don''t get family from the shot.  Looks very posed and non-spontaneous which I think takes away from what i believe to be your intent with the shot.  The foreground is good but the bright water I find distracting.  Makes me want to look lower in the shot which only leaves feet as a focal point.</td>', 'I realize it is probably mom, daughter, son(?) BUT I just don''t get family from the shot.  Looks very posed and non-spontaneous which I think takes away from what i believe to be your intent with the shot.  The foreground is good but the bright water I find distracting.  Makes me want to look lower in the shot which only leaves feet as a focal point.', '2005-07-11 15:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527249, 202447, 37719, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot!  The perspective is perfect.  The lighting is great and adds a sense of age to the shot.  The people seem oblivious to your presence which makes it even better.  Just a family sitting around doing their stuff perhaps after the evening meal.  Even better that they are not watching TV or something.  I am not a big fan of borders but I think this one works nicely.  It lends a sense of age to the photo that is synergistic with the lighting.  Well done!</td>', 'I really like this shot!  The perspective is perfect.  The lighting is great and adds a sense of age to the shot.  The people seem oblivious to your presence which makes it even better.  Just a family sitting around doing their stuff perhaps after the evening meal.  Even better that they are not watching TV or something.  I am not a big fan of borders but I think this one works nicely.  It lends a sense of age to the photo that is synergistic with the lighting.  Well done!', '2005-07-11 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527253, 202446, 34906, '<td valign="top">Excellent candid.  Background is distracting.</td>', 'Excellent candid.  Background is distracting.', '2005-07-11 15:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527257, 202404, 37719, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get family from this shot.  Especially since the person in the shot could never have known the person in the grave.  I do get a sense of despair, depression, loneliness, detachment.  All great to be conveyed by a photo.  But I just don''t get family.</td>', 'I just don''t get family from this shot.  Especially since the person in the shot could never have known the person in the grave.  I do get a sense of despair, depression, loneliness, detachment.  All great to be conveyed by a photo.  But I just don''t get family.', '2005-07-11 15:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527259, 201983, 30822, '<td valign="top">Wow, there have been some great shots in  thsi challenge. I have given lots of 7, 8, &amp; 9''s. This is my first 10. Well composed &amp; exposed. Lovely expression. Well done.</td>', 'Wow, there have been some great shots in  thsi challenge. I have given lots of 7, 8, & 9''s. This is my first 10. Well composed & exposed. Lovely expression. Well done.', '2005-07-11 15:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527262, 202444, 34906, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing capture.  I really like the tone.</td>', 'Very pleasing capture.  I really like the tone.', '2005-07-11 15:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527265, 202274, 34906, '<td valign="top">Funny idea!  Enjoyable image.</td>', 'Funny idea!  Enjoyable image.', '2005-07-11 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527272, 202460, 34906, '<td valign="top">Cute kids!  Almost an excellent photo.  A little more light and contrast would have helped for me.</td>', 'Cute kids!  Almost an excellent photo.  A little more light and contrast would have helped for me.', '2005-07-11 15:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527273, 202151, 27293, '<td valign="top">Plastic, static smiles... i never could understand why anyone would make or want a photo like this. Nothing personal, and definitely nothing against the models. It just doesn''t make sense to me, sorry.<br/> <br/>Of technical aspects, you might want to either take shots like this farther from walls, or diffuse the flash with a diffuser or by bouncing it off of the ceiling. That would make the shadows on the wall much less defined.</td>', 'Plastic, static smiles... i never could understand why anyone would make or want a photo like this. Nothing personal, and definitely nothing against the models. It just doesn''t make sense to me, sorry. Of technical aspects, you might want to either take shots like this farther from walls, or diffuse the flash with a diffuser or by bouncing it off of the ceiling. That would make the shadows on the wall much less defined.', '2005-07-11 15:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1527276, 202329, 37719, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of two children in the field.  I think the bottom could have been cropped closer to get rid of the OOF portion.  Other than your title there is nothing that connects this, for me anyway, to family.  Just two kids in a field.  It is not even clear, without close scutiny, that either one is picking flowers let alone picking flowers for mommy.  Perhaps if mommy was in the shot it would help.</td>', 'Nice photo of two children in the field.  I think the bottom could have been cropped closer to get rid of the OOF portion.  Other than your title there is nothing that connects this, for me anyway, to family.  Just two kids in a field.  It is not even clear, without close scutiny, that either one is picking flowers let alone picking flowers for mommy.  Perhaps if mommy was in the shot it would help.', '2005-07-11 15:43:33.000000', NULL, 1);
