(1528509, 200291, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is just a quick snapshot and needs a bit of oomph to really have the appeal a winning photo has. The background is too dark and I''d like to see his face more detailed. You could crop out the barbeque, the meat and just focus in on dad and it might be a hell of a shot.</td>', 'This is just a quick snapshot and needs a bit of oomph to really have the appeal a winning photo has. The background is too dark and I''d like to see his face more detailed. You could crop out the barbeque, the meat and just focus in on dad and it might be a hell of a shot.', '2005-07-11 23:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1528517, 202345, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would be more effective if he were in focus and the background wasn''t so cluttered. There isn''t anything for the eye to be drawn to cause there is so much going on.  I''d crop out some of the upper part so that the proportions of the shot are more equal.</td>', 'This would be more effective if he were in focus and the background wasn''t so cluttered. There isn''t anything for the eye to be drawn to cause there is so much going on.  I''d crop out some of the upper part so that the proportions of the shot are more equal.', '2005-07-11 23:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
