(1528610, 202064, 25787, '<td valign="top">Midday sun is very harsh.  It gives too much contrast and makes for a cold picture.  I like the idea, but I would have tried this in the hour before sunset.  I would have zoomed in on the kids as well.  If you couldn''t do it at that time, a fill flash would have also helped.</td>', 'Midday sun is very harsh.  It gives too much contrast and makes for a cold picture.  I like the idea, but I would have tried this in the hour before sunset.  I would have zoomed in on the kids as well.  If you couldn''t do it at that time, a fill flash would have also helped.', '2005-07-11 23:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
