(1528833, 202289, 30822, '<td valign="top">Great capyure and exp. The look of fun on his/her face is great. A little lower might have helped this not look so much like a snapshot. Good job! 8.</td>', 'Great capyure and exp. The look of fun on his/her face is great. A little lower might have helped this not look so much like a snapshot. Good job! 8.', '2005-07-12 00:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1528837, 202504, 34985, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I think the photo is a little too soft though.</td>', 'Nice idea. I think the photo is a little too soft though.', '2005-07-12 00:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1528865, 202404, 11800, '<td valign="top">Processing: ok. Some of the lighter parts seem unnaturally light for some reason. The far shoulder really draws my attention away from the face. The person is in a convincing pose with just the right amount of sadness expressed. I''m a bit puzzled about why someone so young should be so sad about a woman that died in 1904. The life of the (presumed)ancestor made the life of the person possible.  Shouldn''t the living rejoice instead?</td>', 'Processing: ok. Some of the lighter parts seem unnaturally light for some reason. The far shoulder really draws my attention away from the face. The person is in a convincing pose with just the right amount of sadness expressed. I''m a bit puzzled about why someone so young should be so sad about a woman that died in 1904. The life of the (presumed)ancestor made the life of the person possible.  Shouldn''t the living rejoice instead?', '2005-07-12 01:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1528881, 202044, 11800, '<td valign="top">Yellow is the perfect color for summer. The towels add a good forground interest.  And I can (just barely) see people behind some rails.  All the ingredients are present for a pleasant picture. All the stuff between the towels and the people could have been eliminated for a more focused presentation of your idea.  Moving in closer to the pool would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Yellow is the perfect color for summer. The towels add a good forground interest.  And I can (just barely) see people behind some rails.  All the ingredients are present for a pleasant picture. All the stuff between the towels and the people could have been eliminated for a more focused presentation of your idea.  Moving in closer to the pool would have helped a lot.', '2005-07-12 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1528899, 201805, 11800, '<td valign="top">Well. To me, it does say family.<br/>The head of the woman is in what looks like a very awkward position. It almost hurts my neck to look at it. A camera position a little more to the the left of the frame would have allowed the photographer to get more of the baby''s facial features in the picture.</td>', 'Well. To me, it does say family.The head of the woman is in what looks like a very awkward position. It almost hurts my neck to look at it. A camera position a little more to the the left of the frame would have allowed the photographer to get more of the baby''s facial features in the picture.', '2005-07-12 01:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1528901, 201668, 11800, '<td valign="top">well. ok. if you say so dear.</td>', 'well. ok. if you say so dear.', '2005-07-12 01:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
