(1529523, 201717, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  They are so cute!  Good DOF, but I think the glare on the water is a bit distracting (IMHO).  I think that if the lighting/highlights were toned down, the colors on the ducklings and the water, as well as the DOF, would really stand out more.  Still a nice shot.  6</td>', 'Great composition.  They are so cute!  Good DOF, but I think the glare on the water is a bit distracting (IMHO).  I think that if the lighting/highlights were toned down, the colors on the ducklings and the water, as well as the DOF, would really stand out more.  Still a nice shot.  6', '2005-07-12 10:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529525, 202316, 12505, '<td valign="top">Good composure</td>', 'Good composure', '2005-07-12 10:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529527, 202469, 20530, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, young love... Normally, I''m not crazy about overexposed shots, but this one works for me. I''m guessing you have a well defined, edgy style. Very cool.</td>', 'Ohhh, young love... Normally, I''m not crazy about overexposed shots, but this one works for me. I''m guessing you have a well defined, edgy style. Very cool.', '2005-07-12 10:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
