(1529645, 202504, 24454, '<td valign="top">Theres''s something about this picture that really makes me like it.  This would have been a great entry for the feet challenge we had a while back.   Very creative and out-of-the-box, which I happen to like a lot.</td>', 'Theres''s something about this picture that really makes me like it.  This would have been a great entry for the feet challenge we had a while back.   Very creative and out-of-the-box, which I happen to like a lot.', '2005-07-12 12:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529648, 202498, 24454, '<td valign="top">How beautiful!   How can anything say "family" more than a brand new addition to one!  Great use of black and white.  I love it.</td>', 'How beautiful!   How can anything say "family" more than a brand new addition to one!  Great use of black and white.  I love it.', '2005-07-12 12:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529652, 201625, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   I LOVE duck pictures (obviously if you look at my profile)  -- IF  they are really good ones -- and THIS one is REALLY good!.   This is so incredibly sharp and clean, with nice blue water in the background.   And I love the way the little fellows seem to be interacting with each other.    I''m adding this to my favorites.   This is a precious picture of a little duck family!!!  10</td>', 'Wow!   I LOVE duck pictures (obviously if you look at my profile)  -- IF  they are really good ones -- and THIS one is REALLY good!.   This is so incredibly sharp and clean, with nice blue water in the background.   And I love the way the little fellows seem to be interacting with each other.    I''m adding this to my favorites.   This is a precious picture of a little duck family!!!  10', '2005-07-12 12:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529654, 201515, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Their interaction is so sweet and unposed looking, but in a perfect "posed" setting for a great portrait.   Beautiful models too.</td>', 'I love this!  Their interaction is so sweet and unposed looking, but in a perfect "posed" setting for a great portrait.   Beautiful models too.', '2005-07-12 12:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529659, 202304, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the vintage look to this.   I love your "only slightly" out-of-the-box" idea -- just enough to be creative and still meet the challenge.   I really like the composition and quality of the photo a lot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love the vintage look to this.   I love your "only slightly" out-of-the-box" idea -- just enough to be creative and still meet the challenge.   I really like the composition and quality of the photo a lot.  Good luck.', '2005-07-12 12:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529663, 202478, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a family photograph -- and composed very well.    I don''t know if the title is for real -- but if it is -- Please do. . . he is so worth it!   :)</td>', 'Great idea for a family photograph -- and composed very well.    I don''t know if the title is for real -- but if it is -- Please do. . . he is so worth it!   :)', '2005-07-12 12:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529665, 202210, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. . . that is so cute!!!     You have composed this so well with the all-white background.   And it''s very  impressive how you have so many animals in one shot, and they are all crisp and clean.   Excellent job.</td>', 'Awwwww. . . that is so cute!!!     You have composed this so well with the all-white background.   And it''s very  impressive how you have so many animals in one shot, and they are all crisp and clean.   Excellent job.', '2005-07-12 12:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529694, 202331, 24073, '<td valign="top">A very good photo indeed.  However their are alot of contrasting colors here, the orange, green, black, and then the tree, and it doesnt seem to have any certain theme &lt;-----Im not sure thats the right word, just no colaberation of all the colors.  Still a very good photo.</td>', 'A very good photo indeed.  However their are alot of contrasting colors here, the orange, green, black, and then the tree, and it doesnt seem to have any certain theme <-----Im not sure thats the right word, just no colaberation of all the colors.  Still a very good photo.', '2005-07-12 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529701, 201949, 3569, '<td valign="top">ya need at least two graves for a family.   <br/> <br/>Okay, ya got me,  I won''t change the score, that was based on the shot, but, yes family can be one.  I was looking at the old grave, and thinking family plot (all of my ancesters graves I have visited are family plots back to 1810s.   Yes families visit or try to find graves of family. So it fits better now.</td>', 'ya need at least two graves for a family.    Okay, ya got me,  I won''t change the score, that was based on the shot, but, yes family can be one.  I was looking at the old grave, and thinking family plot (all of my ancesters graves I have visited are family plots back to 1810s.   Yes families visit or try to find graves of family. So it fits better now.', '2005-07-12 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529702, 202261, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is without competition, my favorite photo in this challenge.  I love it.   It looks so unposed, and. . . .let''s see what else do I love about it besides how natural it looks:  the sepia tones, how sharp and focused it is, how cute the people are (sorry,  that helps too, you know how beauty sells  :),   and the composition.  There are probably other things, but that''s enough to hope this one gets blue in my book.   10</td>', 'This is without competition, my favorite photo in this challenge.  I love it.   It looks so unposed, and. . . .let''s see what else do I love about it besides how natural it looks:  the sepia tones, how sharp and focused it is, how cute the people are (sorry,  that helps too, you know how beauty sells  :),   and the composition.  There are probably other things, but that''s enough to hope this one gets blue in my book.   10', '2005-07-12 12:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529712, 202073, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute "family" picture.   Very well composed, very natural looking, thanks to your great little models, and perfect use of black &amp; white / sepia tones.   I love it.</td>', 'This is such a cute "family" picture.   Very well composed, very natural looking, thanks to your great little models, and perfect use of black & white / sepia tones.   I love it.', '2005-07-12 12:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529717, 200213, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is really cool looking!   What a clean, sharp silhouette!  I just love it.</td>', 'This is really cool looking!   What a clean, sharp silhouette!  I just love it.', '2005-07-12 12:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529722, 200819, 24454, '<td valign="top">Fantastic bird shot.   So amazingly sharp and clean.   I love it!</td>', 'Fantastic bird shot.   So amazingly sharp and clean.   I love it!', '2005-07-12 12:44:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1529778, 201823, 24073, '<td valign="top">yes yes, my first nine.</td>', 'yes yes, my first nine.', '2005-07-12 13:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529785, 201320, 19978, '<td valign="top">A wonderful conceptual take on the challenge, but the image doesn''t quite work. The foreground tree has a fuzzy quality about it (as do the shoes) that makes it a bit hard to look at. The background blue is a nice tone but maybe a little strong. In considering how to improve this shot, I think maybe a more oblique sun angle would have helped, as well as moving in a bit to get a sharper impression of the shoes. I''m giving you an above average score though, for the concept. Brilliant!</td>', 'A wonderful conceptual take on the challenge, but the image doesn''t quite work. The foreground tree has a fuzzy quality about it (as do the shoes) that makes it a bit hard to look at. The background blue is a nice tone but maybe a little strong. In considering how to improve this shot, I think maybe a more oblique sun angle would have helped, as well as moving in a bit to get a sharper impression of the shoes. I''m giving you an above average score though, for the concept. Brilliant!', '2005-07-12 13:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529789, 202439, 19978, '<td valign="top">Shot through a car window?? The image has a hazy caste about it that is unsettling. If it was clearer and sharper, would be a magnificent print.</td>', 'Shot through a car window?? The image has a hazy caste about it that is unsettling. If it was clearer and sharper, would be a magnificent print.', '2005-07-12 13:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529790, 202447, 19978, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept and wonderfully executed, but that frame is awful.</td>', 'Brilliant concept and wonderfully executed, but that frame is awful.', '2005-07-12 13:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529797, 202428, 19978, '<td valign="top">Great concept and capture but move in and fill the frame! A might tighter crop would have been wonderful here.</td>', 'Great concept and capture but move in and fill the frame! A might tighter crop would have been wonderful here.', '2005-07-12 13:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529798, 201438, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this.   I really like the way you have it cropped, and since it''s obvious that this is a picture of children, it does convey family.   Good luck.</td>', 'I love this.   I really like the way you have it cropped, and since it''s obvious that this is a picture of children, it does convey family.   Good luck.', '2005-07-12 13:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529799, 201612, 19978, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully executed, superb concept. Best pic so far in this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderfully executed, superb concept. Best pic so far in this challenge.', '2005-07-12 13:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529801, 201459, 24454, '<td valign="top">How cute!   Very nice compositiion and depth of field.</td>', 'How cute!   Very nice compositiion and depth of field.', '2005-07-12 13:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
