(1529949, 202007, 2764, '<td valign="top">cute pups - I, also, am about to be reduced to a family of dogs.  Your pose is odd, it looks like the lab is about to poop on his little friend.</td>', 'cute pups - I, also, am about to be reduced to a family of dogs.  Your pose is odd, it looks like the lab is about to poop on his little friend.', '2005-07-12 14:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529958, 202447, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is great - has an old feel with modern clues.  Could it be the early sixties?  Nope, look at the Lance Armstrong bracelets.  Your fly-on-the-wall angle is perfect, I love the highlights that the lamps casts.</td>', 'This is great - has an old feel with modern clues.  Could it be the early sixties?  Nope, look at the Lance Armstrong bracelets.  Your fly-on-the-wall angle is perfect, I love the highlights that the lamps casts.', '2005-07-12 14:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529967, 202137, 35645, '<td valign="top">This could be a very nice portrait. Would like to see both of her eyes in focus. Perhaps a touch of gaussian blur to even out skin texture ( and no I''m not talking about messing with the freckles!) or perhaps a light layer of makeup. Otherwise this is beautiful - good lighting, wonderful composition, very nice expression. I lik ethe choice of B&amp;W for this, but I think a color version would also have done well.</td>', 'This could be a very nice portrait. Would like to see both of her eyes in focus. Perhaps a touch of gaussian blur to even out skin texture ( and no I''m not talking about messing with the freckles!) or perhaps a light layer of makeup. Otherwise this is beautiful - good lighting, wonderful composition, very nice expression. I lik ethe choice of B&W for this, but I think a color version would also have done well.', '2005-07-12 14:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529976, 202284, 2764, '<td valign="top">lighting is lovely, so is the story-  i love a picture that tells a story.</td>', 'lighting is lovely, so is the story-  i love a picture that tells a story.', '2005-07-12 14:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1529985, 202331, 2764, '<td valign="top">wow - intense - love the colors, love the hands over her heart - advice?  blur the background?  fix the higlights on her lips?</td>', 'wow - intense - love the colors, love the hands over her heart - advice?  blur the background?  fix the higlights on her lips?', '2005-07-12 14:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
