(1530001, 202076, 2764, '<td valign="top">not sure all the stuff on the left and right contribute to the scene, esp the house in the background.  Did you try a tighter crop?</td>', 'not sure all the stuff on the left and right contribute to the scene, esp the house in the background.  Did you try a tighter crop?', '2005-07-12 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
