(1530408, 202502, 39531, '<td valign="top">nice shot but, a bit soft ... I also would have cropped the wandering spare arm out of the left side. That might have required a tighter crop around your main subject but, I think that would have been more effective anyway.</td>', 'nice shot but, a bit soft ... I also would have cropped the wandering spare arm out of the left side. That might have required a tighter crop around your main subject but, I think that would have been more effective anyway.', '2005-07-12 16:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
