(1530529, 201036, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, not crazy about the color filter used on this.  People in the back ground are a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea, not crazy about the color filter used on this.  People in the back ground are a little distracting.', '2005-07-12 17:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
