(1530653, 201855, 37409, '<td valign="top">Good title.<br/>Shot seems OOF, ie the birds are not as sharp as they could be. I recently had the same problem. Some said if I was using a zoom and was on the end of the zoom I really should use a tripod, no matter how steady I can hand hold. This will produce dramatically sharper images. I went and recomposed the same shot and they were correct.</td>', 'Good title.Shot seems OOF, ie the birds are not as sharp as they could be. I recently had the same problem. Some said if I was using a zoom and was on the end of the zoom I really should use a tripod, no matter how steady I can hand hold. This will produce dramatically sharper images. I went and recomposed the same shot and they were correct.', '2005-07-12 18:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
