(1531183, 201360, 36628, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell just which part of the shot the focus is on. It also seems like it was shot at a very high ISO, and the noise makes the background distracting. In terms of composition, the stick in the background is also distracting from the bees and flowers. Without the stick though, I really like the composition and colors.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell just which part of the shot the focus is on. It also seems like it was shot at a very high ISO, and the noise makes the background distracting. In terms of composition, the stick in the background is also distracting from the bees and flowers. Without the stick though, I really like the composition and colors.', '2005-07-12 23:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
