(1531225, 200880, 36628, '<td valign="top">The focus is really good on the ducks, but the color balanace feels off. I''m not sure what PP you did, but an auto color/auto levels, a cooling filter, or a reduction in the Red channel would have helped out alot.</td>', 'The focus is really good on the ducks, but the color balanace feels off. I''m not sure what PP you did, but an auto color/auto levels, a cooling filter, or a reduction in the Red channel would have helped out alot.', '2005-07-12 23:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1531243, 201717, 36628, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition/focus/exposure of this image but it looks like it was taken at a very high ISO, and the color-noise really detracts from the image. You might also try switching the picture to B&amp;W, as noise is more common in B&amp;W pictures.</td>', 'I really like the composition/focus/exposure of this image but it looks like it was taken at a very high ISO, and the color-noise really detracts from the image. You might also try switching the picture to B&W, as noise is more common in B&W pictures.', '2005-07-12 23:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
