(1531417, 202256, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like thsi representation of family, and the quasi-panoramic view.  The sky looks a bit muted andI wish there was more detail on the man.  However, I am sure this was a question of lighting and it might not be adjustable.  I love the depth of field and the green in the tide pool area.</td>', 'I like thsi representation of family, and the quasi-panoramic view.  The sky looks a bit muted andI wish there was more detail on the man.  However, I am sure this was a question of lighting and it might not be adjustable.  I love the depth of field and the green in the tide pool area.', '2005-07-13 00:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1531422, 202239, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love that he''s holding the remote and looks standoffish and she looks like she''s about to say something.  I wish you could have taken the picture down behind them, it''s a little distracting because of teh hard edges.  I also would have liked to see the woman''s entire hands, they seem to be cropped in an unnatural spot.</td>', 'I love that he''s holding the remote and looks standoffish and she looks like she''s about to say something.  I wish you could have taken the picture down behind them, it''s a little distracting because of teh hard edges.  I also would have liked to see the woman''s entire hands, they seem to be cropped in an unnatural spot.', '2005-07-13 00:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1531426, 202328, 1993, '<td valign="top">I think I get what you were going for, but I think the cropping might have hindered your imagery, a little.  The composition isn''t very strong.  I think you need a different perspective...maybe more sky too.  Not sure.</td>', 'I think I get what you were going for, but I think the cropping might have hindered your imagery, a little.  The composition isn''t very strong.  I think you need a different perspective...maybe more sky too.  Not sure.', '2005-07-13 00:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
