(1534615, 201612, 28742, '<td valign="top">With all the talk about titles in the forums, I am trying to look at the photos without reading the titles. When I did that here, I had to sit here and let my imagination come up with the story - so this disturbed kid and his psycho dad try to offer me drugs to incapacitate me so they can bury me alive in the woods near the slaughterhouse where they work. - - - Now let me read the title... OMG! I wasn''t even close! Sorry. LOL ;-)</td>', 'With all the talk about titles in the forums, I am trying to look at the photos without reading the titles. When I did that here, I had to sit here and let my imagination come up with the story - so this disturbed kid and his psycho dad try to offer me drugs to incapacitate me so they can bury me alive in the woods near the slaughterhouse where they work. - - - Now let me read the title... OMG! I wasn''t even close! Sorry. LOL ;-)', '2005-07-14 03:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1534618, 202404, 28742, '<td valign="top">Please forgive me if I am wrong, but this loks like an obvious staged shot - the problem here is that you are trying to convince the viewer that the person is mourning over the deceased person, but the headstone is so obviously waaaay old that it doesn''t fit together and that jumps out right away.</td>', 'Please forgive me if I am wrong, but this loks like an obvious staged shot - the problem here is that you are trying to convince the viewer that the person is mourning over the deceased person, but the headstone is so obviously waaaay old that it doesn''t fit together and that jumps out right away.', '2005-07-14 03:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
