(1535170, 200794, 34192, '<td valign="top">While watching fireworks is interesting, a photo of fireworks is not,  unless you include something of reference.  The most successful fireworks shots show something with them - a skyline, a family shillouette, a building - something that references a sense of place.  With regard to the photo itself, the image captured is in focus and sharp - very well done considering the difficulty.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'While watching fireworks is interesting, a photo of fireworks is not,  unless you include something of reference.  The most successful fireworks shots show something with them - a skyline, a family shillouette, a building - something that references a sense of place.  With regard to the photo itself, the image captured is in focus and sharp - very well done considering the difficulty.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-14 11:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535172, 201773, 34192, '<td valign="top">While the scene is pretty I think it suffers from over sharpening artifacts.  Like the crisp white against the blue.  the texture of the water is well done.</td>', 'While the scene is pretty I think it suffers from over sharpening artifacts.  Like the crisp white against the blue.  the texture of the water is well done.', '2005-07-14 11:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
