(1535181, 202064, 34192, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge.  As far as the image goes, I think it is a little clutters.  The tree interferes with a clear view of the kids.  If you have moved to the left to have the water as a backdrop, I think it may have much improved the image.  Seems the lighting was harsh at the time the image was taken.  Hate the sun sometimes!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great take on the challenge.  As far as the image goes, I think it is a little clutters.  The tree interferes with a clear view of the kids.  If you have moved to the left to have the water as a backdrop, I think it may have much improved the image.  Seems the lighting was harsh at the time the image was taken.  Hate the sun sometimes!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-14 11:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535185, 202286, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think the DOF and POV are great for this shot.  The image as a whole is rather dark and could be improved with greater contrast, maybe moving your white point in levels in PS.</td>', 'I think the DOF and POV are great for this shot.  The image as a whole is rather dark and could be improved with greater contrast, maybe moving your white point in levels in PS.', '2005-07-14 11:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
