(1535470, 202385, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all but the foliage in the foreground is just distracting and doesn´t do anything positive for this image IMHO, next time I would suggest you standing up or moving to the side.  Other than that it has a pretty good quality, nice colours sharpness and contrast.</td>', 'Not bad at all but the foliage in the foreground is just distracting and doesn´t do anything positive for this image IMHO, next time I would suggest you standing up or moving to the side.  Other than that it has a pretty good quality, nice colours sharpness and contrast.', '2005-07-14 13:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535471, 201612, 34192, '<td valign="top">Crop, compositions, tones, DOF, POV all well done.  The look on the father''s face - concern mixed with anticipation is great (my interpretation anyway).  I can see he''s about to move forward.  Very well done. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Crop, compositions, tones, DOF, POV all well done.  The look on the father''s face - concern mixed with anticipation is great (my interpretation anyway).  I can see he''s about to move forward.  Very well done. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-14 13:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535476, 200764, 37215, '<td valign="top">looks like a paperweight! not sure what this is or how it reflects family apart from title</td>', 'looks like a paperweight! not sure what this is or how it reflects family apart from title', '2005-07-14 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535479, 200267, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture showing family dynamics.  Good use of selective desat.  Only thing I can see to pick on here is the slightly blown whites.  Love that the ''center'' is oblivious to everything else.  8  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent capture showing family dynamics.  Good use of selective desat.  Only thing I can see to pick on here is the slightly blown whites.  Love that the ''center'' is oblivious to everything else.  8  good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-14 13:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535489, 201438, 34192, '<td valign="top">like this image.  Kind of wistful.  excellent crop, composition, POV works for me.  Tones well done.  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'like this image.  Kind of wistful.  excellent crop, composition, POV works for me.  Tones well done.  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-14 13:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535503, 201668, 38592, '<td valign="top">Best shot of the challenge.  Only thing I can think of that would have made this better is slightly more DOF making the front drawer a little more in focus.  Good job!</td>', 'Best shot of the challenge.  Only thing I can think of that would have made this better is slightly more DOF making the front drawer a little more in focus.  Good job!', '2005-07-14 13:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535505, 202404, 31567, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful photograph, I love the emotion. Great interpritation of the challenge.</td>', 'this is a beautiful photograph, I love the emotion. Great interpritation of the challenge.', '2005-07-14 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
