(1535512, 202307, 38592, '<td valign="top">Funny pic.  I think I would have rated this a bit higher if you had more of the board in the picture as well as a bit more DOF.</td>', 'Funny pic.  I think I would have rated this a bit higher if you had more of the board in the picture as well as a bit more DOF.', '2005-07-14 13:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
