(1535522, 202470, 38592, '<td valign="top">I like the use of blur in this picture, however I wish it was a bit lighter to get some more of the detail in the back.</td>', 'I like the use of blur in this picture, however I wish it was a bit lighter to get some more of the detail in the back.', '2005-07-14 14:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
