(1535542, 202151, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all but I couldn´t give this more than 5 for 3 reasons.<br/> <br/>1.  It´s slanting slightly to the left.<br/> <br/>2. The direct flash gives off hideous shadows, if the lighting isnt enough for ambient shooting, try bouncing the flash and if you can´t do that move them somewhere else.<br/> <br/>3.  The picture is a bit flat to work as a b/w shot, needs more contrast or something to make it pop more off the screen.<br/> <br/>Anyway, not bad at all like I said and congratulations on the wedding, this shot is most definately fitting for this challenge.</td>', 'Not bad at all but I couldn´t give this more than 5 for 3 reasons. 1.  It´s slanting slightly to the left. 2. The direct flash gives off hideous shadows, if the lighting isnt enough for ambient shooting, try bouncing the flash and if you can´t do that move them somewhere else. 3.  The picture is a bit flat to work as a b/w shot, needs more contrast or something to make it pop more off the screen. Anyway, not bad at all like I said and congratulations on the wedding, this shot is most definately fitting for this challenge.', '2005-07-14 14:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535572, 202137, 16493, '<td valign="top">the dof is too shallow - the left eye is not in focus - everything else is great.</td>', 'the dof is too shallow - the left eye is not in focus - everything else is great.', '2005-07-14 14:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535576, 200880, 16493, '<td valign="top">whis you had cough the head inside the frame too.</td>', 'whis you had cough the head inside the frame too.', '2005-07-14 14:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535578, 202137, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w portrait but too shallow DOF IMHO, I am drawn towards the eye to the right and its irritatingly out of focus so this is not as good as it could have been, again IMHO.  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice b/w portrait but too shallow DOF IMHO, I am drawn towards the eye to the right and its irritatingly out of focus so this is not as good as it could have been, again IMHO.  6 from me.', '2005-07-14 14:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535582, 201515, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the colours/contrast/sharpness and their expressions too, excellent candid.  However it´s framed a bit too tight for my taste, you both cut off parts of their feet and the top of the older sisters head.</td>', 'Nice, I like the colours/contrast/sharpness and their expressions too, excellent candid.  However it´s framed a bit too tight for my taste, you both cut off parts of their feet and the top of the older sisters head.', '2005-07-14 14:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535590, 202399, 27482, '<td valign="top">I may be wrong here, but the jagged edges around the babies head and her head in particular lead me to believe the backround blur was added later but not really important.  Just looks "wrong" somehow.<br/> <br/>Anyway, the image is very nice, love the lighting and it´s a very fitting shot for this challenge and as a bonus the image quality is very good, you got a 7 from me.</td>', 'I may be wrong here, but the jagged edges around the babies head and her head in particular lead me to believe the backround blur was added later but not really important.  Just looks "wrong" somehow. Anyway, the image is very nice, love the lighting and it´s a very fitting shot for this challenge and as a bonus the image quality is very good, you got a 7 from me.', '2005-07-14 14:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535591, 201438, 5792, '<td valign="top">Touching subject taken from an interestng perspective. Very strong and well composed. B&amp;W works well.<br/> <br/>Fits the challenge topic exceptionally well. In general it is  technically well done. Theer are a couple hot spots on the image you might consider burining in. One is at the upper left corner and the other are a couple spots on the left side child''s pants. While you are burining in things you might consider additional dodge and burn to add more tecxture to the tocks and water. It will give the image more visual impact.</td>', 'Touching subject taken from an interestng perspective. Very strong and well composed. B&W works well. Fits the challenge topic exceptionally well. In general it is  technically well done. Theer are a couple hot spots on the image you might consider burining in. One is at the upper left corner and the other are a couple spots on the left side child''s pants. While you are burining in things you might consider additional dodge and burn to add more tecxture to the tocks and water. It will give the image more visual impact.', '2005-07-14 14:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535598, 202478, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sheesh, what an depressing image you put up here, very symbolic.  I would never hang around with my wife just because of my kids if I didn´t love her, I don´t think I would be doing anybody any favours if that were the case.  <br/> <br/>Anyway, this image works as it stopped me in my tracks and bummed me out and made me think of all the people that are not as fortunate as me, I now want to go home from work and hug my wife very badly.  <br/> <br/>I gave you a pretty high score, 8 as the image itself isn´t perfect technically but you made me feel something wich I don´t often when looking at photographs here.</td>', 'Sheesh, what an depressing image you put up here, very symbolic.  I would never hang around with my wife just because of my kids if I didn´t love her, I don´t think I would be doing anybody any favours if that were the case.   Anyway, this image works as it stopped me in my tracks and bummed me out and made me think of all the people that are not as fortunate as me, I now want to go home from work and hug my wife very badly.   I gave you a pretty high score, 8 as the image itself isn´t perfect technically but you made me feel something wich I don´t often when looking at photographs here.', '2005-07-14 14:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535603, 200267, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of desat to draw attention to your main character in the image. It is unclear what people are looking at but it does not appear to be the boy. Fits the challenge.<br/> <br/>The white dress and blouse are overexposed and should be burned to try to get more detail. Horizon needs to be level. This wrong horizon shows up three distinct ways. One is the people all appear to lean to the right. A second is the apper to get shorter moving from left to right. and lastly the background wall shows a strong downward right tilt.</td>', 'Interesting use of desat to draw attention to your main character in the image. It is unclear what people are looking at but it does not appear to be the boy. Fits the challenge. The white dress and blouse are overexposed and should be burned to try to get more detail. Horizon needs to be level. This wrong horizon shows up three distinct ways. One is the people all appear to lean to the right. A second is the apper to get shorter moving from left to right. and lastly the background wall shows a strong downward right tilt.', '2005-07-14 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535605, 200825, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool composition and what is this place, some kind of museum?  Like this shot but don´t love it, it makes me curious to where they are.</td>', 'Pretty cool composition and what is this place, some kind of museum?  Like this shot but don´t love it, it makes me curious to where they are.', '2005-07-14 14:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535624, 202220, 36628, '<td valign="top">This has a little too much ''snapshot'' feel to it. Mostly I think it comes from the harsh lighting which is probably due to time of day, so theres not alot to do about it. When taking pictures in these conditions you might try setting the exposure compensation (assuming your camera has one) to -2/3 or even -1.</td>', 'This has a little too much ''snapshot'' feel to it. Mostly I think it comes from the harsh lighting which is probably due to time of day, so theres not alot to do about it. When taking pictures in these conditions you might try setting the exposure compensation (assuming your camera has one) to -2/3 or even -1.', '2005-07-14 14:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535642, 202076, 36628, '<td valign="top">I like the way you did the de-sat on this, it really brings attention to the subject but I think that the crop dissapated some of the attention. You might try bring it in closer on both sides. Also, the vertical lines all lean a little to the right which is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the way you did the de-sat on this, it really brings attention to the subject but I think that the crop dissapated some of the attention. You might try bring it in closer on both sides. Also, the vertical lines all lean a little to the right which is a little distracting.', '2005-07-14 14:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535653, 202306, 36628, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you applied a warming filter to this, but it feels a bit too orange/red, especially on the lable of the bottle.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you applied a warming filter to this, but it feels a bit too orange/red, especially on the lable of the bottle.', '2005-07-14 14:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535666, 200880, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good concept, an image of a  mother protecting her young. Side angle works well.<br/> <br/>A series of technical issues hurt this image. The centered composition, though not bad, might be more visually appealing if the you applied a different compositional arrangement such applying the rule of thirds. By far the most interesting part of the image is the ducklings and they should be highlighted as much as possible. A closer crop of the ducklings would show the viewer more detail.<br/> <br/>The colors seem weak, particularly the green of the grass. It also looks like the shutter speed was slow because one of the ducklings is out of focus due to movement. A wider aperture at a faster shutter speed would have helped. You might consider light dodging of the rear duckling to bring out more detail out of the shadows. <br/> <br/>Lastly, the grass kinda has that digital "fuzzy oversharpened" look. I struggle with overcoming that in a lot of my images. One way is to duplicate the background to another layer, apply gassian blur to soften the image and reduce the opacity of the burred layer to around 20% or so. That takes some of the edge off the fine detail in the grass.</td>', 'Good concept, an image of a  mother protecting her young. Side angle works well. A series of technical issues hurt this image. The centered composition, though not bad, might be more visually appealing if the you applied a different compositional arrangement such applying the rule of thirds. By far the most interesting part of the image is the ducklings and they should be highlighted as much as possible. A closer crop of the ducklings would show the viewer more detail. The colors seem weak, particularly the green of the grass. It also looks like the shutter speed was slow because one of the ducklings is out of focus due to movement. A wider aperture at a faster shutter speed would have helped. You might consider light dodging of the rear duckling to bring out more detail out of the shadows.  Lastly, the grass kinda has that digital "fuzzy oversharpened" look. I struggle with overcoming that in a lot of my images. One way is to duplicate the background to another layer, apply gassian blur to soften the image and reduce the opacity of the burred layer to around 20% or so. That takes some of the edge off the fine detail in the grass.', '2005-07-14 14:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535669, 200794, 39144, '<td valign="top">Family???</td>', 'Family???', '2005-07-14 14:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535671, 201965, 37740, '<td valign="top">Very simple and artistic, good work.</td>', 'Very simple and artistic, good work.', '2005-07-14 14:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535673, 202286, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a little brighter or more contrasty to bring out the good whites.</td>', 'I think this could be a little brighter or more contrasty to bring out the good whites.', '2005-07-14 14:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535677, 202404, 37740, '<td valign="top">I like it very much</td>', 'I like it very much', '2005-07-14 14:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535678, 201823, 36628, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty harsh in this, and it looks like you used a really high ISO - the noise in it really detracts from the colors of the peppers.</td>', 'The lighting is pretty harsh in this, and it looks like you used a really high ISO - the noise in it really detracts from the colors of the peppers.', '2005-07-14 14:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535682, 202428, 37740, '<td valign="top">Good shot, too bad about the cars in the background.</td>', 'Good shot, too bad about the cars in the background.', '2005-07-14 14:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535684, 202331, 37740, '<td valign="top">Good shot</td>', 'Good shot', '2005-07-14 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535686, 200542, 37740, '<td valign="top">Great exposure, color and contrast.</td>', 'Great exposure, color and contrast.', '2005-07-14 14:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535691, 202439, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture, but it looks like it might have been a little over saturated. The sky is a tad unnatural looking.</td>', 'This is a great picture, but it looks like it might have been a little over saturated. The sky is a tad unnatural looking.', '2005-07-14 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535699, 202137, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting B&amp;W portraiture. Shallow depth of field with the center focus on the left eye is a great idea and makes the composition very interesting. Lighting is good with a full tonal range and it is properly exposed. Great capture of a Mona Lisa expression.<br/> <br/>Nitpicking "meet the challenge" voters will call this is a "portrait" of an individual and NOT really "family" and vote this fine image lower because of it.</td>', 'Interesting B&W portraiture. Shallow depth of field with the center focus on the left eye is a great idea and makes the composition very interesting. Lighting is good with a full tonal range and it is properly exposed. Great capture of a Mona Lisa expression. Nitpicking "meet the challenge" voters will call this is a "portrait" of an individual and NOT really "family" and vote this fine image lower because of it.', '2005-07-14 15:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535702, 202357, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a hard shot to make, the lighting and reflections make it difficult to isolate your subjects but I think a different, more straight on  angle might have emphasized the ''one is missing'' idea. It also seems like a bit of a stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'This is a hard shot to make, the lighting and reflections make it difficult to isolate your subjects but I think a different, more straight on  angle might have emphasized the ''one is missing'' idea. It also seems like a bit of a stretch for the challenge.', '2005-07-14 15:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1535708, 202503, 36628, '<td valign="top">The colors in this image make it a but too busy for the subjects and mood. You might want to try it in B&amp;W or partially de-saturated to tone it down a little bit.</td>', 'The colors in this image make it a but too busy for the subjects and mood. You might want to try it in B&W or partially de-saturated to tone it down a little bit.', '2005-07-14 15:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
