(1536178, 202413, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>The photo is very grainy. It doesn''t portray any idea of family. The lighting from the window is overdone. Better luck next time.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Photo Quality: 0/2Composition: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 The photo is very grainy. It doesn''t portray any idea of family. The lighting from the window is overdone. Better luck next time.', '2005-07-14 19:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
