(1536256, 202478, 36628, '<td valign="top">The only gripe I have are the patches of red on the childs shoulder, which look a blown out</td>', 'The only gripe I have are the patches of red on the childs shoulder, which look a blown out', '2005-07-14 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536258, 202460, 36628, '<td valign="top">This picture is pretty flat. Boosting the contrast or levels in this would really give it a lot more impact.</td>', 'This picture is pretty flat. Boosting the contrast or levels in this would really give it a lot more impact.', '2005-07-14 19:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536262, 202147, 36628, '<td valign="top">I wish the whites weren''t quite so exposed on the gulls head, but other than that great picture</td>', 'I wish the whites weren''t quite so exposed on the gulls head, but other than that great picture', '2005-07-14 19:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536269, 202073, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think this is just a little bit underexposed. A good thing to go for when doing portrait style photos or any photo where people are a large part of the subject is to get their eyes as close to white as possible. There are a number of ways to do this, such as upping the contrast or increasting the brightness.</td>', 'I think this is just a little bit underexposed. A good thing to go for when doing portrait style photos or any photo where people are a large part of the subject is to get their eyes as close to white as possible. There are a number of ways to do this, such as upping the contrast or increasting the brightness.', '2005-07-14 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536295, 201984, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely framed (the shorelines, not the border) and captures the spirit of the challenge exceptionally well. Congratulations</td>', 'This is very nicely framed (the shorelines, not the border) and captures the spirit of the challenge exceptionally well. Congratulations', '2005-07-14 20:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536337, 201535, 37961, '<td valign="top">I think I know whose submission this is, and since I like you and your work. I must vote you high. :)</td>', 'I think I know whose submission this is, and since I like you and your work. I must vote you high. :)', '2005-07-14 20:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536338, 201668, 37961, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha!  Classic.</td>', 'ha ha ha!  Classic.', '2005-07-14 20:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536341, 202273, 37961, '<td valign="top">Now thats touching. 8</td>', 'Now thats touching. 8', '2005-07-14 21:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536342, 201515, 37961, '<td valign="top">Large age gap? Looks more like mother and daughter. Closer in age would have had more impact I think. Cute pose though.</td>', 'Large age gap? Looks more like mother and daughter. Closer in age would have had more impact I think. Cute pose though.', '2005-07-14 21:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536343, 202291, 37961, '<td valign="top">Living Legacy. This pic I''m sure makes you proud.</td>', 'Living Legacy. This pic I''m sure makes you proud.', '2005-07-14 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536397, 200213, 30364, '<td valign="top">Three daughters?  Don''t you think that''s taking the Rule of Thirds too far?  Lovely family scene.  I especially like your POV ... it breaks the jumping daughters'' earthly shackles entirely; joie-de-vivre!  I''d have knocked a sliver off the side behind Dad, to lose the little square thing behind the tree.  Otherwise it''s terrific.  10</td>', 'Three daughters?  Don''t you think that''s taking the Rule of Thirds too far?  Lovely family scene.  I especially like your POV ... it breaks the jumping daughters'' earthly shackles entirely; joie-de-vivre!  I''d have knocked a sliver off the side behind Dad, to lose the little square thing behind the tree.  Otherwise it''s terrific.  10', '2005-07-14 21:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536414, 200764, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, it looks like a petrie dish ... is it a family of bacteria?  It''s a very striking image, anyway, although I think it would have more impact without the frame line.  6</td>', 'Well, it looks like a petrie dish ... is it a family of bacteria?  It''s a very striking image, anyway, although I think it would have more impact without the frame line.  6', '2005-07-14 21:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536425, 202137, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s a very nice portrait.  The severe cropping and especially the limited depth of field elevate it well above the ordinary for me.  Love the title for this challenge, although there''s something about your shot that conveys an unmistakable family relationship anyway.  Well done.   8</td>', 'That''s a very nice portrait.  The severe cropping and especially the limited depth of field elevate it well above the ordinary for me.  Love the title for this challenge, although there''s something about your shot that conveys an unmistakable family relationship anyway.  Well done.   8', '2005-07-14 22:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536444, 200542, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a terrific photograph.  Title aside, it doesn''t really suggest "family" to me, but I don''t care about that at all.  It is a wonderful, exuberant pose and a casual yet meticulous composition.  Best of all, it''s a great idea for a memorable image which I think both photographer and model will treasure forever.  10</td>', 'It''s a terrific photograph.  Title aside, it doesn''t really suggest "family" to me, but I don''t care about that at all.  It is a wonderful, exuberant pose and a casual yet meticulous composition.  Best of all, it''s a great idea for a memorable image which I think both photographer and model will treasure forever.  10', '2005-07-14 22:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536460, 202440, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love the title, and the nostalgic feel of the image.  It''s one of those rare family "snaps" that''s actually a lot more than what it first appears to be.  A beautiful tribute to your parents.  8</td>', 'Love the title, and the nostalgic feel of the image.  It''s one of those rare family "snaps" that''s actually a lot more than what it first appears to be.  A beautiful tribute to your parents.  8', '2005-07-14 22:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536470, 202239, 30364, '<td valign="top">They look like nice parents to me.  A  very good, unpretentious photograph that nevertheless reveals something intimate about the character of the subjects; just what a family photograph should be.  8</td>', 'They look like nice parents to me.  A  very good, unpretentious photograph that nevertheless reveals something intimate about the character of the subjects; just what a family photograph should be.  8', '2005-07-14 22:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536476, 200770, 30364, '<td valign="top">Hard to comment on this.  I remember this moment well; another father but the same scene.  Vale.</td>', 'Hard to comment on this.  I remember this moment well; another father but the same scene.  Vale.', '2005-07-14 22:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536477, 202284, 36628, '<td valign="top">Alot of the impact of this picture is lost to me in the upper right hand corner. I think it would be a much stronger image if you cropped out the right half, even at the expense of that lovly young lady :(</td>', 'Alot of the impact of this picture is lost to me in the upper right hand corner. I think it would be a much stronger image if you cropped out the right half, even at the expense of that lovly young lady :(', '2005-07-14 22:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536479, 200542, 32754, '<td valign="top">This for some reason, is very appealing..I''m not certain if it''s the composition or the sense of fun;  the brick, the position of her hands, the overall image is just wonderful and spontaneous.</td>', 'This for some reason, is very appealing..I''m not certain if it''s the composition or the sense of fun;  the brick, the position of her hands, the overall image is just wonderful and spontaneous.', '2005-07-14 22:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536486, 202182, 36628, '<td valign="top">The lighting is perhaps a little bit harsh, and it seems like a bit of a stretch to meet the challenge</td>', 'The lighting is perhaps a little bit harsh, and it seems like a bit of a stretch to meet the challenge', '2005-07-14 22:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536487, 201949, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop on the bottom and left side would strengthen this image quite a bit</td>', 'I think a closer crop on the bottom and left side would strengthen this image quite a bit', '2005-07-14 22:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536488, 201772, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good metaphoric image/idea &amp; good photograph.  It''s strange; as I look at these tangled roots I can just about see glimpses of people in there, or at least bits of people.  Arms, torsos, etc.  It''s a very organic sort of image.  Oh dear, no more whiskey for me tonight.  8</td>', 'Good metaphoric image/idea & good photograph.  It''s strange; as I look at these tangled roots I can just about see glimpses of people in there, or at least bits of people.  Arms, torsos, etc.  It''s a very organic sort of image.  Oh dear, no more whiskey for me tonight.  8', '2005-07-14 22:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536500, 202385, 36628, '<td valign="top">This has a kind of horror-movie feel to it, like something is about to leap out of the bushes! I think the composition is cool, but the lighting is really harsh - alot of overexposed highlights.</td>', 'This has a kind of horror-movie feel to it, like something is about to leap out of the bushes! I think the composition is cool, but the lighting is really harsh - alot of overexposed highlights.', '2005-07-14 22:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536503, 201668, 30364, '<td valign="top">Not everyone''s idealised family scene, but the unselfconscious, intimate chaos does unmistakably say "family".  Not a beautiful image, but effective, and a lot more memorable than most in this challenge.   7</td>', 'Not everyone''s idealised family scene, but the unselfconscious, intimate chaos does unmistakably say "family".  Not a beautiful image, but effective, and a lot more memorable than most in this challenge.   7', '2005-07-14 22:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536511, 201772, 36628, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture but I''m having a hard time getting it to convey and idea of family.</td>', 'I really like this picture but I''m having a hard time getting it to convey and idea of family.', '2005-07-14 22:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536513, 201630, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photograph; better than some I''ve voted higher.  It''s interesting and visually appealing, and a clever, effective composition.  My only problem is that, notwithstanding your efforts to the contrary with your title, it''s not about family.  At least not to me.  The fact that the subject is a member of a family, even if it''s YOUR family, doesn''t make it an image about family. I might have voted it 8 in another context, but in this one, 6.</td>', 'This is a nice photograph; better than some I''ve voted higher.  It''s interesting and visually appealing, and a clever, effective composition.  My only problem is that, notwithstanding your efforts to the contrary with your title, it''s not about family.  At least not to me.  The fact that the subject is a member of a family, even if it''s YOUR family, doesn''t make it an image about family. I might have voted it 8 in another context, but in this one, 6.', '2005-07-14 22:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536515, 202454, 36628, '<td valign="top">I really like the picture, but I feel like the title forces it a little  too much.</td>', 'I really like the picture, but I feel like the title forces it a little  too much.', '2005-07-14 22:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536516, 202391, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very good family portrait.  Nice composition, nice processing ... nice family.  7</td>', 'A very good family portrait.  Nice composition, nice processing ... nice family.  7', '2005-07-14 22:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536518, 202334, 36628, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is a bit harsh, and the image is flat. Depending on your editing program, you might try increasing the Contrast or playing with the Levels to give the image more pop</td>', 'The lighting in this is a bit harsh, and the image is flat. Depending on your editing program, you might try increasing the Contrast or playing with the Levels to give the image more pop', '2005-07-14 22:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536524, 201923, 30364, '<td valign="top">Gone to get fuel for the mower, I hope!  Interesting photograph, made especially so by the person (is it mother?) in the background.  I like the dark, gothic tones, but not so much the theatrical processing of the sky.  7</td>', 'Gone to get fuel for the mower, I hope!  Interesting photograph, made especially so by the person (is it mother?) in the background.  I like the dark, gothic tones, but not so much the theatrical processing of the sky.  7', '2005-07-14 23:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536525, 202441, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, but its a little flat - too much overall greyness. Depending on your editing program, you might try increasing the contrast or playing with the levels in order to give your image more ''pop''</td>', 'This is a nice image, but its a little flat - too much overall greyness. Depending on your editing program, you might try increasing the contrast or playing with the levels in order to give your image more ''pop''', '2005-07-14 23:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536529, 202451, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the sepia.  maybe not so many pictures would work better for me, it has become quite cluttered and lost a lot of it''s emotiveness.   perhaps a more dramatic angle would work better for me as well.</td>', 'i like the sepia.  maybe not so many pictures would work better for me, it has become quite cluttered and lost a lot of it''s emotiveness.   perhaps a more dramatic angle would work better for me as well.', '2005-07-14 23:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536534, 200915, 36628, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you tried it, but I think this image would be much better in B&amp;W as the noise would look a little more ''natural''</td>', 'I don''t know if you tried it, but I think this image would be much better in B&W as the noise would look a little more ''natural''', '2005-07-14 23:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536538, 200825, 30364, '<td valign="top">Looks spectacular, although I actually feel that the striking setting overpowers the nominative subjects, and makes this a photograph about something else ... light? ... architecture? ... photography?  Whatever, it''s impossible to overlook, and will do well in the voting.  5</td>', 'Looks spectacular, although I actually feel that the striking setting overpowers the nominative subjects, and makes this a photograph about something else ... light? ... architecture? ... photography?  Whatever, it''s impossible to overlook, and will do well in the voting.  5', '2005-07-14 23:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536544, 201805, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like that you''ve tried to add interest to the pic with an odd angle. though i think you went a bit over the top.  no offense but your wife''s bossom seems to be the focus of the pic since her eyes point toward it and your child isn''t looking at the camera making the head blend in rather than stand out. i''m thinking more patience with your idea would have ultimately provided a better composition.</td>', 'i like that you''ve tried to add interest to the pic with an odd angle. though i think you went a bit over the top.  no offense but your wife''s bossom seems to be the focus of the pic since her eyes point toward it and your child isn''t looking at the camera making the head blend in rather than stand out. i''m thinking more patience with your idea would have ultimately provided a better composition.', '2005-07-14 23:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536546, 200764, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo, but  I don''t see the connection to the challenge.  I will be interested to read your comments at the end of the challenge.  I hope you''ll tell us what this is.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo, but  I don''t see the connection to the challenge.  I will be interested to read your comments at the end of the challenge.  I hope you''ll tell us what this is.', '2005-07-14 23:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536552, 200794, 33400, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice capture of a firework.  But the challenge was to make me think of family and I just don''t see it here.</td>', 'This is a very nice capture of a firework.  But the challenge was to make me think of family and I just don''t see it here.', '2005-07-14 23:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536558, 202007, 13688, '<td valign="top">i find the placement of their eyes making for a very good composition of the dogs.  but i find the arm of the bench cutting through the center of the pic very distracting.  when i photograph my dog, i like to take the tags off.  I feel it lessens the "snapshot" type of feel to the pic.</td>', 'i find the placement of their eyes making for a very good composition of the dogs.  but i find the arm of the bench cutting through the center of the pic very distracting.  when i photograph my dog, i like to take the tags off.  I feel it lessens the "snapshot" type of feel to the pic.', '2005-07-14 23:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536561, 202286, 33400, '<td valign="top">I came back to this picture and raised my score a point.  I do see the family feel to it.  In my opinion the light is a bit dim and the focus is not what it could be.</td>', 'I came back to this picture and raised my score a point.  I do see the family feel to it.  In my opinion the light is a bit dim and the focus is not what it could be.', '2005-07-14 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536565, 201655, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice emotion from their expressions. like the backlighting.  the grain and odd contrast just don''t feel right.</td>', 'nice emotion from their expressions. like the backlighting.  the grain and odd contrast just don''t feel right.', '2005-07-14 23:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536572, 200880, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think this could of worked without the mother''s head...but you really needed to show a lower angle and definitely gotten her feet involved.  the way you''ve done it she just looks decapitated.  i really like the 1 bird closest to the mom.  but i don''t like that bird compositional centered.  the blur on the 1 next to it is a bit distracting so i think a quicker shutter might have improved the overall picture, eventhough the focus on the mother bird''s feathers is very good.  i hope this is helpful</td>', 'i think this could of worked without the mother''s head...but you really needed to show a lower angle and definitely gotten her feet involved.  the way you''ve done it she just looks decapitated.  i really like the 1 bird closest to the mom.  but i don''t like that bird compositional centered.  the blur on the 1 next to it is a bit distracting so i think a quicker shutter might have improved the overall picture, eventhough the focus on the mother bird''s feathers is very good.  i hope this is helpful', '2005-07-14 23:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536580, 202331, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice focus. nice lighting.  looks like you used a flash that was very mellow and definitely enhanced the pic for me, though the reflection on her lips is slightly distracting, and draws me away from their eyes, which i feel is the best part.   i hate the background you''ve chosen.</td>', 'nice focus. nice lighting.  looks like you used a flash that was very mellow and definitely enhanced the pic for me, though the reflection on her lips is slightly distracting, and draws me away from their eyes, which i feel is the best part.   i hate the background you''ve chosen.', '2005-07-14 23:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536602, 202385, 13688, '<td valign="top">this is very odd...though i''m thinking extremely unintended.  you have positioned yourself to be at a view of a wilderness stalker be it man or animal.  i just finished a jeffrey deaver book...maybe that''s my problem. i think you could have done a lot more with this family as you "stalked" them down the river...i think you just needed to wait for a better composition.</td>', 'this is very odd...though i''m thinking extremely unintended.  you have positioned yourself to be at a view of a wilderness stalker be it man or animal.  i just finished a jeffrey deaver book...maybe that''s my problem. i think you could have done a lot more with this family as you "stalked" them down the river...i think you just needed to wait for a better composition.', '2005-07-14 23:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536617, 202325, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like your composition.  i have trouble with the difference in focus between the 2nd and 3rd pair.  maybe it also has something to do with the lighting shift on the 3rd pair on the logo.  not sure about the title not being ray ban''s?  is bahn some sort of james bond sounding reference...i''m lost, but that isn''t so surprising.</td>', 'i like your composition.  i have trouble with the difference in focus between the 2nd and 3rd pair.  maybe it also has something to do with the lighting shift on the 3rd pair on the logo.  not sure about the title not being ray ban''s?  is bahn some sort of james bond sounding reference...i''m lost, but that isn''t so surprising.', '2005-07-14 23:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536632, 200770, 29241, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what to do with this photo. This is the 5th time that I''ve looked at it. It''s kinda morbid and has nothing to do with "family" until you read the title. Exposure &amp; focus are good, Composition is very interesting. This is really freaky but I keep coming back to it....</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what to do with this photo. This is the 5th time that I''ve looked at it. It''s kinda morbid and has nothing to do with "family" until you read the title. Exposure & focus are good, Composition is very interesting. This is really freaky but I keep coming back to it....', '2005-07-14 23:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536633, 202169, 20662, '<td valign="top">Is she taking a break from the family? It''s a lovely photo but I''m not getting where the family part comes in.</td>', 'Is she taking a break from the family? It''s a lovely photo but I''m not getting where the family part comes in.', '2005-07-14 23:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536635, 202108, 20662, '<td valign="top">I love this one</td>', 'I love this one', '2005-07-14 23:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536636, 201367, 20662, '<td valign="top">great expression!</td>', 'great expression!', '2005-07-14 23:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536637, 201965, 13688, '<td valign="top">good idea.  your lighting is very harsh though. i believe the shadows could have worked if only if they were alot stronger, so your best bet was probably to get rid of them with another angle of light(s) or reflector(s).  the wrinkles in your sheet distract a bunch., and looks like they just could have been pulled out.  the positioning of the shoes seems a bit safe, but definitely works.  perhaps rearranging the postion of the pairings might have provided a more dynamic shot.  upon further reflection just switching the brother and older daughter''s might help break things up.</td>', 'good idea.  your lighting is very harsh though. i believe the shadows could have worked if only if they were alot stronger, so your best bet was probably to get rid of them with another angle of light(s) or reflector(s).  the wrinkles in your sheet distract a bunch., and looks like they just could have been pulled out.  the positioning of the shoes seems a bit safe, but definitely works.  perhaps rearranging the postion of the pairings might have provided a more dynamic shot.  upon further reflection just switching the brother and older daughter''s might help break things up.', '2005-07-14 23:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536638, 201625, 29241, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2005-07-14 23:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
