(1536656, 202391, 20662, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful family you have -- nice photo too!</td>', 'What a beautiful family you have -- nice photo too!', '2005-07-15 00:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536659, 202331, 20662, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2005-07-15 00:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536669, 202198, 20662, '<td valign="top">like the concept but don''t understand the remote being in the photo.</td>', 'like the concept but don''t understand the remote being in the photo.', '2005-07-15 00:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536672, 201515, 29241, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo! The only thing I could offer is to crop the bottom 20% off and see how it looks. Cropping the toes off is a bit distracting to me. Also try cropping the left edge so the umbrella fills the frame. I absolutely love their expressions!! If these were my sisters, I would hang this one on the wall. Nice Job!   7</td>', 'This is a very nice photo! The only thing I could offer is to crop the bottom 20% off and see how it looks. Cropping the toes off is a bit distracting to me. Also try cropping the left edge so the umbrella fills the frame. I absolutely love their expressions!! If these were my sisters, I would hang this one on the wall. Nice Job!   7', '2005-07-15 00:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536681, 202331, 29241, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph! The tree on the left and right are a bit distracting, I would also consider cropping the top 10% off but this would definately be hanging on my wall!! Great job!  7</td>', 'I love this photograph! The tree on the left and right are a bit distracting, I would also consider cropping the top 10% off but this would definately be hanging on my wall!! Great job!  7', '2005-07-15 00:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536692, 202291, 16493, '<td valign="top">Try using flash when taking pictures out side. i.e. think you would get more detail on the dogs fur. pjus.</td>', 'Try using flash when taking pictures out side. i.e. think you would get more detail on the dogs fur. pjus.', '2005-07-15 00:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536713, 201535, 29241, '<td valign="top">The sister on the right seems very distracted and OOF. The sister on the left is perfect.</td>', 'The sister on the right seems very distracted and OOF. The sister on the left is perfect.', '2005-07-15 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536714, 200213, 29241, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2005-07-15 00:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536750, 202347, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like that you have the road leading off to a good focal point so this pic isn''t totally centered.  it seems you might have distorted things when you resized it.  the lighting is tough, but next time try to expose for their faces (currently under exposed) so you have better detail in them which i assume would be your main point of interest in this shot.  the lighting is low so you need to be really firm when holding the camera because in this instance your focus is soft (blurry).</td>', 'i like that you have the road leading off to a good focal point so this pic isn''t totally centered.  it seems you might have distorted things when you resized it.  the lighting is tough, but next time try to expose for their faces (currently under exposed) so you have better detail in them which i assume would be your main point of interest in this shot.  the lighting is low so you need to be really firm when holding the camera because in this instance your focus is soft (blurry).', '2005-07-15 00:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536803, 202373, 4767, '<td valign="top">NICE bokeh! Sweet child pic.  Looks like a keeper to me!</td>', 'NICE bokeh! Sweet child pic.  Looks like a keeper to me!', '2005-07-15 01:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536813, 200253, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice focus on the face.  i like this better than most of the snapshots.  conveys a nice family moment.  the moving spoon is very distracting</td>', 'nice focus on the face.  i like this better than most of the snapshots.  conveys a nice family moment.  the moving spoon is very distracting', '2005-07-15 01:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536827, 202056, 13688, '<td valign="top">well i can''t figure out what you''ve done here...so it is intriguing in that respect.  At first i thought it was a mirror image but I think i see 4 different rings which seems odd as a symbol for marriage.  anyway, the light refractions from the glass around a couple of the rings are a bit annoying.  the centered composition is a bit static.  the background color and lighting are terribly bland, though your shadow removal was well done.  your focus is very soft.  perhaps perusing the previous jewelryadvertisement challenge might provide some useful insight.</td>', 'well i can''t figure out what you''ve done here...so it is intriguing in that respect.  At first i thought it was a mirror image but I think i see 4 different rings which seems odd as a symbol for marriage.  anyway, the light refractions from the glass around a couple of the rings are a bit annoying.  the centered composition is a bit static.  the background color and lighting are terribly bland, though your shadow removal was well done.  your focus is very soft.  perhaps perusing the previous jewelryadvertisement challenge might provide some useful insight.', '2005-07-15 01:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536832, 201652, 13688, '<td valign="top">is that a real tattoo on her?...i feel really, really old now...thanks.  your lighting is good the photo is really crisp, unfortunately the photo keeps me about as interested as your subjects appear to be.</td>', 'is that a real tattoo on her?...i feel really, really old now...thanks.  your lighting is good the photo is really crisp, unfortunately the photo keeps me about as interested as your subjects appear to be.', '2005-07-15 01:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536839, 202327, 13688, '<td valign="top">seems a bit over sharpened.  the doorway is distracting as well are the shoelaces running off of the page.  I think this could have been a more interesting shot from a different angle with a bit more exotic lighting.</td>', 'seems a bit over sharpened.  the doorway is distracting as well are the shoelaces running off of the page.  I think this could have been a more interesting shot from a different angle with a bit more exotic lighting.', '2005-07-15 02:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536846, 202354, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m thinking this image needed a grandpa in it to enhance its appeal and add a more touchy feely family connection.</td>', 'i''m thinking this image needed a grandpa in it to enhance its appeal and add a more touchy feely family connection.', '2005-07-15 02:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536853, 202440, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice feeling.  great lighting.  i feel like i''m sitting there a part of the conversation.  you''ve done a great job to take this beyond what could have been another basic snapshot.  i think your choice of border helps alot as well.</td>', 'nice feeling.  great lighting.  i feel like i''m sitting there a part of the conversation.  you''ve done a great job to take this beyond what could have been another basic snapshot.  i think your choice of border helps alot as well.', '2005-07-15 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536855, 201630, 37740, '<td valign="top">Very good title for your entry. And a good composition as well. Good work... I my opinion this could be a winner ;)</td>', 'Very good title for your entry. And a good composition as well. Good work... I my opinion this could be a winner ;)', '2005-07-15 02:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536862, 201666, 13688, '<td valign="top">i really like the technique you have used. your lighting makes  it looks like a sculpture. i wish you had chosen a different composition.  perhaps cropping out the bottom would help.</td>', 'i really like the technique you have used. your lighting makes  it looks like a sculpture. i wish you had chosen a different composition.  perhaps cropping out the bottom would help.', '2005-07-15 02:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536866, 202367, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting.  wish you hadn''t cropped out the full hand...seems to be a bit of a key point in the composition''s idea</td>', 'interesting lighting.  wish you hadn''t cropped out the full hand...seems to be a bit of a key point in the composition''s idea', '2005-07-15 02:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
