(1536876, 201459, 19311, '<td valign="top">the kids add a nice touch to an already attractive shot.  I wish the flags were more to the right but nothing you can do.</td>', 'the kids add a nice touch to an already attractive shot.  I wish the flags were more to the right but nothing you can do.', '2005-07-15 02:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536878, 201515, 13688, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot. excellent lighting and focus.  great overall composition.  though the more i look at it, the more the placement of the handbag feels forced...unless of course this was a candid, at which point i will now shut up.  But before I do...the border was too daring, and i find it distracting.</td>', 'wonderful shot. excellent lighting and focus.  great overall composition.  though the more i look at it, the more the placement of the handbag feels forced...unless of course this was a candid, at which point i will now shut up.  But before I do...the border was too daring, and i find it distracting.', '2005-07-15 02:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
