(1536898, 202151, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is a nice group portrait, but what''s with the shadows?  Not a bad thing for me, but just looks a little odd..  6</td>', 'This is a nice group portrait, but what''s with the shadows?  Not a bad thing for me, but just looks a little odd..  6', '2005-07-15 02:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536899, 202446, 13688, '<td valign="top">if this is your family i''m confused.  you have 2 wonderful models and you have chosen to take a pic of them doing a rather odd exercise.  why not have them walking down the boardwalk, perhaps with her on his shoulders, perhaps blurring out the background around them (if possible with your lense) to focus on their togetherness...just a thought</td>', 'if this is your family i''m confused.  you have 2 wonderful models and you have chosen to take a pic of them doing a rather odd exercise.  why not have them walking down the boardwalk, perhaps with her on his shoulders, perhaps blurring out the background around them (if possible with your lense) to focus on their togetherness...just a thought', '2005-07-15 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536906, 202399, 13688, '<td valign="top">great exposure and focus.  i understand what you were going for but the bg looks a bit fake, perhaps due to the tough editing around their heads.  if only 1 person where to look at the camera, i would have liked it to be the focal point or in your case, the baby</td>', 'great exposure and focus.  i understand what you were going for but the bg looks a bit fake, perhaps due to the tough editing around their heads.  if only 1 person where to look at the camera, i would have liked it to be the focal point or in your case, the baby', '2005-07-15 02:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1536950, 201697, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice emotion.  i like how 1 is blurred and 1 is focused.  perhaps it mirrors their personalities.  his eyes looking off are great, unfortunately i''m drawn to the brother''s hand on his back, which is cool but seems to distruct the balance of the image and pull me away from the center...since the embrace is an intricate part of the feeling, perhaps cropping down the right side to the ear would help things bleed off the page on the right as you have done on every other side, and rebalance the image...at least for me.  I realize  these are some overly critical comments for what will undoubtably be a very well received  image...sorry...nice capture.</td>', 'nice emotion.  i like how 1 is blurred and 1 is focused.  perhaps it mirrors their personalities.  his eyes looking off are great, unfortunately i''m drawn to the brother''s hand on his back, which is cool but seems to distruct the balance of the image and pull me away from the center...since the embrace is an intricate part of the feeling, perhaps cropping down the right side to the ear would help things bleed off the page on the right as you have done on every other side, and rebalance the image...at least for me.  I realize  these are some overly critical comments for what will undoubtably be a very well received  image...sorry...nice capture.', '2005-07-15 03:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
