(1537466, 201367, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good capture, like the expresion on the boys face.  Same they seems almost totaly in the shadow.  Focus dosent seem right on.  Think pure b&amp;w would have been better than the sepia toning but maybe thats just my prefence.</td>', 'Good capture, like the expresion on the boys face.  Same they seems almost totaly in the shadow.  Focus dosent seem right on.  Think pure b&w would have been better than the sepia toning but maybe thats just my prefence.', '2005-07-15 12:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
