(1537739, 202446, 39111, '<td valign="top">i think i would have preferred more of the street scene to be cropped out, a closer crop in general.  also, if it were taken from a lower perspective, i think i would have connected more with the subject, instead of feeling like i''m just standing by watching, does that make sense?</td>', 'i think i would have preferred more of the street scene to be cropped out, a closer crop in general.  also, if it were taken from a lower perspective, i think i would have connected more with the subject, instead of feeling like i''m just standing by watching, does that make sense?', '2005-07-15 14:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
