(1537844, 202423, 36628, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is a little harsh, and the colors are off. It looks like you may have shot it with a very high ISO and it might be color noise that is throwing it off. It looks like it was pretty sunny outside though, so you probably don''t need such high ISO for that kind of shot (if you were using manual settings)</td>', 'The lighting in this is a little harsh, and the colors are off. It looks like you may have shot it with a very high ISO and it might be color noise that is throwing it off. It looks like it was pretty sunny outside though, so you probably don''t need such high ISO for that kind of shot (if you were using manual settings)', '2005-07-15 15:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537869, 201983, 36628, '<td valign="top">Only thing is the lighting seems a bit harsh for the subject. You might try making the little girl the very right side of the frame, and cropping out an inch or two of the left side to get rid of some of the harsh feel. A nice pic though regardless</td>', 'Only thing is the lighting seems a bit harsh for the subject. You might try making the little girl the very right side of the frame, and cropping out an inch or two of the left side to get rid of some of the harsh feel. A nice pic though regardless', '2005-07-15 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
