(1537882, 200964, 36628, '<td valign="top">This looks just a tad bit underexposed. I''d like to see it a little brighter to really bring out the white in the goose feathers - theyre a little too grey</td>', 'This looks just a tad bit underexposed. I''d like to see it a little brighter to really bring out the white in the goose feathers - theyre a little too grey', '2005-07-15 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537899, 201947, 36628, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting detracts from the feel of the image, but a closer crop on the top, bottom and left might have helped move attention from some of the highlights in the water and  bring more attention onto the ducks.</td>', 'The harsh lighting detracts from the feel of the image, but a closer crop on the top, bottom and left might have helped move attention from some of the highlights in the water and  bring more attention onto the ducks.', '2005-07-15 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
