(1537946, 202325, 36628, '<td valign="top">I''m really confused by this shot...unless your last name is Bahn? but the glasses are spelled Ban, so I''m not sure if its a typo or a play on words...or something else entirely. Really good shot though, would be great for stock.</td>', 'I''m really confused by this shot...unless your last name is Bahn? but the glasses are spelled Ban, so I''m not sure if its a typo or a play on words...or something else entirely. Really good shot though, would be great for stock.', '2005-07-15 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
