(1537968, 202477, 36628, '<td valign="top">The overall quality in this photo is a little poor. Its a little bit soft, flat, and the over exposed highlights are distracting. For the softness, a little sharpening would bring out alot of the details. For the flatness, bringing the contrast up would really make the image pop out to the viewer. For the highlights, its difficult to fix in PP but when shoting try setting your exposure compensation on your camera to -2/3 or -1 then later on in PP you can brighten it up but keep more of the highlights.</td>', 'The overall quality in this photo is a little poor. Its a little bit soft, flat, and the over exposed highlights are distracting. For the softness, a little sharpening would bring out alot of the details. For the flatness, bringing the contrast up would really make the image pop out to the viewer. For the highlights, its difficult to fix in PP but when shoting try setting your exposure compensation on your camera to -2/3 or -1 then later on in PP you can brighten it up but keep more of the highlights.', '2005-07-15 16:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1537973, 202375, 36628, '<td valign="top">Great photo but it feels a little loose on the theme.</td>', 'Great photo but it feels a little loose on the theme.', '2005-07-15 16:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
