(1538317, 200770, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think i''d like this a little better if it were just a tad darker and a closer crop on the left side<br/></td>', 'I think i''d like this a little better if it were just a tad darker and a closer crop on the left side', '2005-07-15 20:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538322, 202430, 36628, '<td valign="top">The way these two are in the picture, it doesnt really look like they have any connection to one another - makes it hard to see any family connection other than the title.</td>', 'The way these two are in the picture, it doesnt really look like they have any connection to one another - makes it hard to see any family connection other than the title.', '2005-07-15 20:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538326, 202291, 36628, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what your camera settings were, but it looks like you had a very high ISO when you shot this. The noise in the dark areas and especially on the dog is very distracting from the rest of the image.</td>', 'I''m not sure what your camera settings were, but it looks like you had a very high ISO when you shot this. The noise in the dark areas and especially on the dog is very distracting from the rest of the image.', '2005-07-15 20:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538327, 201805, 36628, '<td valign="top">The angle of this picture is kindof awkward. I wish either the lady or the baby was positioned vertically.</td>', 'The angle of this picture is kindof awkward. I wish either the lady or the baby was positioned vertically.', '2005-07-15 20:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538330, 202392, 36628, '<td valign="top">Its a little too bright (you might try setting the exposure compensation to -2/3 or -1 when shooting in such bright conditions) and the horizontal lines on the building are tilted a little to the right.</td>', 'Its a little too bright (you might try setting the exposure compensation to -2/3 or -1 when shooting in such bright conditions) and the horizontal lines on the building are tilted a little to the right.', '2005-07-15 20:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538333, 202137, 36628, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure if I like the title but the picture is great!</td>', 'I''m not quite sure if I like the title but the picture is great!', '2005-07-15 20:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538335, 200794, 36628, '<td valign="top">The noise in the background takes away from the image. You might also want to crop it a little bit closer.</td>', 'The noise in the background takes away from the image. You might also want to crop it a little bit closer.', '2005-07-15 20:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538336, 202504, 36628, '<td valign="top">I like the image but I wish it werent quite so soft.</td>', 'I like the image but I wish it werent quite so soft.', '2005-07-15 20:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538342, 201965, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the better shoe entrys, but I feel it would have been helped by a closer crop on the right and left.</td>', 'I think this is one of the better shoe entrys, but I feel it would have been helped by a closer crop on the right and left.', '2005-07-15 20:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538348, 202491, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool photo, especially given the shooting conditions. A little too much noise, although i assume that was to get a fast enough shutter speed.</td>', 'This is a really cool photo, especially given the shooting conditions. A little too much noise, although i assume that was to get a fast enough shutter speed.', '2005-07-15 20:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
