(1538362, 202489, 36628, '<td valign="top">I wish the rose was pulled down a little bit more so that all of "In loving memory of" was all the way visible. A little bit softer lighting would have been nice too to make the pages of the bible similar on the left and right side.</td>', 'I wish the rose was pulled down a little bit more so that all of "In loving memory of" was all the way visible. A little bit softer lighting would have been nice too to make the pages of the bible similar on the left and right side.', '2005-07-15 20:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538381, 201581, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo technically, although it could use just a tiny bit of contrast, but the subject matter and composition make it kindof boring. I''m not sure if you tried shooting different angles, but this one just leads my eye off the screen</td>', 'This is a good photo technically, although it could use just a tiny bit of contrast, but the subject matter and composition make it kindof boring. I''m not sure if you tried shooting different angles, but this one just leads my eye off the screen', '2005-07-15 21:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
