(1538697, 202261, 33672, '<td valign="top">Best in the comp, Very nice work!</td>', 'Best in the comp, Very nice work!', '2005-07-16 00:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538699, 201388, 36981, '<td valign="top">What a bizarre, and yet beautiful, set of tones!  I really like this; it''s one of my favorites.  The pose is very nice, and the background is interesting, but it''s the colors that star in this image, for me at least.  I love that the bit that pulls you in the most is the little girl - she''s adorable!</td>', 'What a bizarre, and yet beautiful, set of tones!  I really like this; it''s one of my favorites.  The pose is very nice, and the background is interesting, but it''s the colors that star in this image, for me at least.  I love that the bit that pulls you in the most is the little girl - she''s adorable!', '2005-07-16 00:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538737, 201668, 3214, '<td valign="top">Talk about exposure!  What a story this tells about family--toddlerss, mom who wears pantyhose and underwire bras, and dad sneaking that moment of focus elsewhere.  Thumbs up from me!</td>', 'Talk about exposure!  What a story this tells about family--toddlerss, mom who wears pantyhose and underwire bras, and dad sneaking that moment of focus elsewhere.  Thumbs up from me!', '2005-07-16 01:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538740, 201388, 3214, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal effect, time of day.</td>', 'Nice tonal effect, time of day.', '2005-07-16 01:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538800, 200213, 39543, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2005-07-16 02:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538817, 202261, 35827, '<td valign="top">this is such a well shot photo! 10</td>', 'this is such a well shot photo! 10', '2005-07-16 02:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538820, 202064, 39111, '<td valign="top">i like the color bars that emerge, the green, then the brown of the bark, then blue of the water...nice image.</td>', 'i like the color bars that emerge, the green, then the brown of the bark, then blue of the water...nice image.', '2005-07-16 03:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538821, 201630, 39111, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture but it''s a stretch for the topic, IMO.</td>', 'beautiful capture but it''s a stretch for the topic, IMO.', '2005-07-16 03:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538822, 202316, 39111, '<td valign="top">i think i would have preferred 2.75 to signify the # of children :)</td>', 'i think i would have preferred 2.75 to signify the # of children :)', '2005-07-16 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538823, 202478, 39111, '<td valign="top">wow.  your title is so powerful.  it really changes everything.</td>', 'wow.  your title is so powerful.  it really changes everything.', '2005-07-16 03:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538863, 201823, 40780, '<td valign="top">Good Lighting</td>', 'Good Lighting', '2005-07-16 05:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538937, 200964, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and sense of family in this shot. I''d really like to see a bit more light on the birds to make them stand out. Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely composition and sense of family in this shot. I''d really like to see a bit more light on the birds to make them stand out. Nice work.', '2005-07-16 06:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538938, 201459, 18450, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot!! Colours, composition, focus and dof are great and the matching body positions really makes the shot!</td>', 'I really like this shot!! Colours, composition, focus and dof are great and the matching body positions really makes the shot!', '2005-07-16 06:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538941, 202331, 18450, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose,lighting and skin colours are lovely and the hand positions are so touching!  Great composition. I''m not sure if it''s possible with your camera but would love to have seen a slightly shallower dof to blurr the b/g and bring total focus on the family. Great family portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful pose,lighting and skin colours are lovely and the hand positions are so touching!  Great composition. I''m not sure if it''s possible with your camera but would love to have seen a slightly shallower dof to blurr the b/g and bring total focus on the family. Great family portrait.', '2005-07-16 06:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538944, 201697, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great sense of fun in this shot, beautiful!!</td>', 'Great sense of fun in this shot, beautiful!!', '2005-07-16 06:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538951, 202451, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great collection of family photos......they''re such precious memories!  To me the lighting appears a little flat in this shot, especially noticeable in the foreground where it''s a little dark.</td>', 'Great collection of family photos......they''re such precious memories!  To me the lighting appears a little flat in this shot, especially noticeable in the foreground where it''s a little dark.', '2005-07-16 06:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1538953, 202488, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great fun, family shot!! Love the facial expressions and the mischief in the eyes of little chip!!</td>', 'Great fun, family shot!! Love the facial expressions and the mischief in the eyes of little chip!!', '2005-07-16 06:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539134, 202413, 31403, '<td valign="top">wow, this evokes some pretty strong emotions, why is the kid bleeding, why is it his first, why is that lady just reading a magazine instead of helping?  Overall a pretty negative experience for me - technically I really like the photo, the subject repels me -6</td>', 'wow, this evokes some pretty strong emotions, why is the kid bleeding, why is it his first, why is that lady just reading a magazine instead of helping?  Overall a pretty negative experience for me - technically I really like the photo, the subject repels me -6', '2005-07-16 11:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539139, 202348, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see more contrast here, maybe crop tighter to just the hand and finger, burn around the edges to draw strengthen the composition - for anyone who''s been here - with a little one struggling, this is a powerful image</td>', 'I''d love to see more contrast here, maybe crop tighter to just the hand and finger, burn around the edges to draw strengthen the composition - for anyone who''s been here - with a little one struggling, this is a powerful image', '2005-07-16 11:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539143, 202198, 31403, '<td valign="top">the hands are great, the remote confuses an otherwise strong shot here.  I''d like to see more of the hands on a darker background - maybe a selective desat leaving the rings in color?  These hands have seen a lot, shoot them often - there''s some great shots there</td>', 'the hands are great, the remote confuses an otherwise strong shot here.  I''d like to see more of the hands on a darker background - maybe a selective desat leaving the rings in color?  These hands have seen a lot, shoot them often - there''s some great shots there', '2005-07-16 11:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539151, 202470, 31403, '<td valign="top">family life maybe, but doesn''t say "family" to me.  Am I the only one to say this?  If I were shoot a laundry room, I would hope it would turn out this good, I can smell the Bounce</td>', 'family life maybe, but doesn''t say "family" to me.  Am I the only one to say this?  If I were shoot a laundry room, I would hope it would turn out this good, I can smell the Bounce', '2005-07-16 11:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539152, 201630, 31403, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo</td>', 'Beautiful photo', '2005-07-16 11:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539196, 202413, 11800, '<td valign="top">The thing I find interesting about this picture is the woman is sitting there smiling and reading a magazine.  Excuse me, but shouldn''t someone be concerned enough to clean the child''s nose?<br/>Sorry if that sounds catty, but geez... ?</td>', 'The thing I find interesting about this picture is the woman is sitting there smiling and reading a magazine.  Excuse me, but shouldn''t someone be concerned enough to clean the child''s nose?Sorry if that sounds catty, but geez... ?', '2005-07-16 11:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539201, 202056, 11800, '<td valign="top">Control of the light is pretty good with just a couple of hot spots, exposure is about right. Now. Work on the composition a little and this would be a better picture. Centered compositions just don''t have enough impact.</td>', 'Control of the light is pretty good with just a couple of hot spots, exposure is about right. Now. Work on the composition a little and this would be a better picture. Centered compositions just don''t have enough impact.', '2005-07-16 12:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539211, 202316, 40825, '<td valign="top">Elegant and classic. Nice rosey tones.</td>', 'Elegant and classic. Nice rosey tones.', '2005-07-16 12:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539212, 201612, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very much on topic and clearly presented with great processing.<br/>Ha. You said it was a secret.   I''ve been having a good time finding yours, but guess what? It was to easy to find.</td>', 'Very much on topic and clearly presented with great processing.Ha. You said it was a secret.   I''ve been having a good time finding yours, but guess what? It was to easy to find.', '2005-07-16 12:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539228, 202306, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what a bottle of wine has to do with family.  I do see "family vinyards" ,btw. There isn''t anything in the family pictures to connect them with the bottle of wine, as being part of the Sutter family.<br/>The family pictures don''t look right. or maybe it''s the composition. Whatever it is is causing me to study the picture but not enjoy it. It might be because the background is maybe on a computer screen and there is a lack of shadows.</td>', 'I don''t understand what a bottle of wine has to do with family.  I do see "family vinyards" ,btw. There isn''t anything in the family pictures to connect them with the bottle of wine, as being part of the Sutter family.The family pictures don''t look right. or maybe it''s the composition. Whatever it is is causing me to study the picture but not enjoy it. It might be because the background is maybe on a computer screen and there is a lack of shadows.', '2005-07-16 12:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539230, 200764, 11800, '<td valign="top">pretty colors and pretty picture. I don''t think I can connect this with family since I can''t understand what it is. Maybe a paperweight. It is a lovely picture that would be wonderful in an abstract challenge.</td>', 'pretty colors and pretty picture. I don''t think I can connect this with family since I can''t understand what it is. Maybe a paperweight. It is a lovely picture that would be wonderful in an abstract challenge.', '2005-07-16 12:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539237, 201772, 11800, '<td valign="top">Oh man, and then the textures challenge was announced. Nice processing. Can''t exactly get my mind to accept this as a good representative for family. If it had even a small seedling growing somewhere in the scene, you would have gotten high marks from me.</td>', 'Oh man, and then the textures challenge was announced. Nice processing. Can''t exactly get my mind to accept this as a good representative for family. If it had even a small seedling growing somewhere in the scene, you would have gotten high marks from me.', '2005-07-16 12:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539241, 200826, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like it. Makes me remember my family''s camping trips when I was a kid.</td>', 'I like it. Makes me remember my family''s camping trips when I was a kid.', '2005-07-16 12:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539246, 202291, 11800, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. On my monitor, there seems to be a strong green tint.</td>', 'Lovely picture. On my monitor, there seems to be a strong green tint.', '2005-07-16 12:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539250, 202392, 15919, '<td valign="top">Light pretty hard.  Othervise ok.</td>', 'Light pretty hard.  Othervise ok.', '2005-07-16 12:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
