(1539254, 201949, 15919, '<td valign="top">Has to be explaned by the title.  imho the image have to be able to stand for the subject bye itself without any explanation.  Also the image dont excite me visually.</td>', 'Has to be explaned by the title.  imho the image have to be able to stand for the subject bye itself without any explanation.  Also the image dont excite me visually.', '2005-07-16 12:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
