(1539362, 202421, 40829, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition of different photographs.</td>', 'Interesting composition of different photographs.', '2005-07-16 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539389, 202391, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome portrait!! I love it. Great lighting and exposure. A very smooth, warm feeling image.</td>', 'Awesome portrait!! I love it. Great lighting and exposure. A very smooth, warm feeling image.', '2005-07-16 15:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539419, 202316, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, artistic and tasteful. I like the title, it''s cool. Well done.</td>', 'Wow, artistic and tasteful. I like the title, it''s cool. Well done.', '2005-07-16 16:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539429, 202044, 2764, '<td valign="top">I like the concept - the image turned out a little too cluttered.  I like the foregound towels and backpack except for the oof blue blanket and I like the umbrella and kids in the background - maybe less stuff in the middle would make the idea clearer?  Where is the pool, the title makes me think a pool will be the focal point..</td>', 'I like the concept - the image turned out a little too cluttered.  I like the foregound towels and backpack except for the oof blue blanket and I like the umbrella and kids in the background - maybe less stuff in the middle would make the idea clearer?  Where is the pool, the title makes me think a pool will be the focal point..', '2005-07-16 16:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539432, 202451, 2764, '<td valign="top">oh very nice!  my grandmother had a table just like this.  great attention to detail in the set up.  Sepia is perfect.</td>', 'oh very nice!  my grandmother had a table just like this.  great attention to detail in the set up.  Sepia is perfect.', '2005-07-16 16:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539435, 201666, 2764, '<td valign="top">ew - a plaster cast?  maybe crop the extra finger at the bottom?</td>', 'ew - a plaster cast?  maybe crop the extra finger at the bottom?', '2005-07-16 16:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539436, 202488, 2764, '<td valign="top">luaghed out loud - What a treasure for years to come!  Priceless.</td>', 'luaghed out loud - What a treasure for years to come!  Priceless.', '2005-07-16 16:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539437, 201717, 2764, '<td valign="top">Little ducks NEVER hold still so I know this was not an easy shot t get.  High on the cute scale.</td>', 'Little ducks NEVER hold still so I know this was not an easy shot t get.  High on the cute scale.', '2005-07-16 16:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539438, 200763, 2764, '<td valign="top">Excellent - an image that speaks to anyone who has been a parent or a child.</td>', 'Excellent - an image that speaks to anyone who has been a parent or a child.', '2005-07-16 16:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539442, 201087, 2764, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expressions - next time move the tree.</td>', 'Wonderful expressions - next time move the tree.', '2005-07-16 16:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539444, 202404, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Sepia and perspective work well for this image. Generally good exposure and dodge and burn done nicely to create an ominous sky. Overall technical quality is OK.<br/> <br/>Some viewers may vote lower from a "meet the challenge" standpoint because they will blieve it is staged. It will be hard for them to believe that the model could have such profound sadness over a lost relative that died in 1904. Some may not like the angled perspective.<br/> <br/>The sky and trees make a great background but the mausoleum and building in the background act as a distraction from your model.</td>', 'Good concept. Sepia and perspective work well for this image. Generally good exposure and dodge and burn done nicely to create an ominous sky. Overall technical quality is OK. Some viewers may vote lower from a "meet the challenge" standpoint because they will blieve it is staged. It will be hard for them to believe that the model could have such profound sadness over a lost relative that died in 1904. Some may not like the angled perspective. The sky and trees make a great background but the mausoleum and building in the background act as a distraction from your model.', '2005-07-16 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539446, 200312, 2764, '<td valign="top">okay here is an example of leading lines that don''t work  - all the lines point to Mom''s crotch.  Look, both of moms arms, and her legs, the line of the towel, the line of daughters arm, I can''t help but think she''s be happier if you cropped off her legs and feet, or if someone had pulled down the towel.  Otherwise a great family portrait.</td>', 'okay here is an example of leading lines that don''t work  - all the lines point to Mom''s crotch.  Look, both of moms arms, and her legs, the line of the towel, the line of daughters arm, I can''t help but think she''s be happier if you cropped off her legs and feet, or if someone had pulled down the towel.  Otherwise a great family portrait.', '2005-07-16 16:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539449, 202439, 2764, '<td valign="top">something about this makes me keep cleaning my glasses.</td>', 'something about this makes me keep cleaning my glasses.', '2005-07-16 16:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539451, 202182, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice green colors. Excellent detail and sharpness in the papaya.<br/> <br/>Many viewers will rate this lower because they will not consider it "real" family. They will "get it" but will feel that a family image should be emotive. This is not.<br/> <br/>The foreground and image detail is good, but the sky background is overexposed. You might try selecting the background sky and toning down the brightness so it is not so overwhelming.  This does not appear to apply any compositional rules and has almost a snapshot perspective to it. You might consider takin itt from different perspectives to give the view a "fresh" look to the subject.</td>', 'Nice green colors. Excellent detail and sharpness in the papaya. Many viewers will rate this lower because they will not consider it "real" family. They will "get it" but will feel that a family image should be emotive. This is not. The foreground and image detail is good, but the sky background is overexposed. You might try selecting the background sky and toning down the brightness so it is not so overwhelming.  This does not appear to apply any compositional rules and has almost a snapshot perspective to it. You might consider takin itt from different perspectives to give the view a "fresh" look to the subject.', '2005-07-16 16:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539453, 202220, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooh mid day sun and shade - very hard to work with.  expose either for the people or the river bank, dont try to get halfway between becasue part will be too bright and part too dark.</td>', 'ooh mid day sun and shade - very hard to work with.  expose either for the people or the river bank, dont try to get halfway between becasue part will be too bright and part too dark.', '2005-07-16 16:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539459, 201652, 2764, '<td valign="top">hey, my daughter has a similar tattoo</td>', 'hey, my daughter has a similar tattoo', '2005-07-16 16:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539460, 200982, 2764, '<td valign="top">eew - those guys the stinging kind?  Great macro of a unsettling subject.</td>', 'eew - those guys the stinging kind?  Great macro of a unsettling subject.', '2005-07-16 16:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539510, 200213, 4493, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t get any better than this! 10!!!!</td>', 'Doesn''t get any better than this! 10!!!!', '2005-07-16 18:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539512, 202329, 4493, '<td valign="top">Just a bit more negative space at top, and a little less from bottom... still a great 9</td>', 'Just a bit more negative space at top, and a little less from bottom... still a great 9', '2005-07-16 18:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539547, 201949, 4767, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful feeling this photo generates!  A very Victorian flavor, imho.  It may be my favorite of the contest so far!</td>', 'What a wonderful feeling this photo generates!  A very Victorian flavor, imho.  It may be my favorite of the contest so far!', '2005-07-16 18:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539552, 202249, 4767, '<td valign="top">What an inviting location; what an inviting photo - pulls the eye into the pic, looks cool and wonderful.</td>', 'What an inviting location; what an inviting photo - pulls the eye into the pic, looks cool and wonderful.', '2005-07-16 18:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539581, 200982, 4767, '<td valign="top">BIIIG family!</td>', 'BIIIG family!', '2005-07-16 19:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1539602, 201630, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo - well composed, interestingly processed; kind of a ''universal woman/modern earth mother'' concept, THEN the title.  After more than a few viewings, I like it better and better.</td>', 'Interesting photo - well composed, interestingly processed; kind of a ''universal woman/modern earth mother'' concept, THEN the title.  After more than a few viewings, I like it better and better.', '2005-07-16 19:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
