(1540408, 201854, 40119, '<td valign="top">thats kind of creepy</td>', 'thats kind of creepy', '2005-07-17 04:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540413, 201535, 23203, '<td valign="top">Nice entry, Artyste! Breanna is a good model!<br/></td>', 'Nice entry, Artyste! Breanna is a good model!', '2005-07-17 04:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540419, 200764, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image might be improved by casting a little more light on the ball at around the 4 o''clock position to give it a bit more depth; as it is the near side of the ball seems a touch flat. This is a nice picture, but even with the title this does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'This image might be improved by casting a little more light on the ball at around the 4 o''clock position to give it a bit more depth; as it is the near side of the ball seems a touch flat. This is a nice picture, but even with the title this does not meet the challenge.', '2005-07-17 05:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540420, 202423, 10261, '<td valign="top">The low angle is a nice touch. How did you pull this off without getting your camera wet?</td>', 'The low angle is a nice touch. How did you pull this off without getting your camera wet?', '2005-07-17 05:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540421, 202248, 10261, '<td valign="top">The family in the foreground seem to be out of focus. Also, the horizon doesn''t look level; see <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=21" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> page for information on how to correct this.</td>', 'The family in the foreground seem to be out of focus. Also, the horizon doesn''t look level; see this page for information on how to correct this.', '2005-07-17 05:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540425, 202347, 10261, '<td valign="top">The aspect ratio seems off in this picture; you appear to have compressed everyone horizontally. In general, pictures of people are much stronger if you can see their eyes. I can''t clearly make out the eyes of anyone in this photo. This is partially because of the angle of the light from above; using a fill flash might have provided enough light to bring out their eyes.</td>', 'The aspect ratio seems off in this picture; you appear to have compressed everyone horizontally. In general, pictures of people are much stronger if you can see their eyes. I can''t clearly make out the eyes of anyone in this photo. This is partially because of the angle of the light from above; using a fill flash might have provided enough light to bring out their eyes.', '2005-07-17 05:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540427, 202502, 10261, '<td valign="top">The shutter speed was way too slow to freeze the action in this picture.  Next time increase the aperture size (smaller f number) or use a tripod.</td>', 'The shutter speed was way too slow to freeze the action in this picture.  Next time increase the aperture size (smaller f number) or use a tripod.', '2005-07-17 05:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540429, 202286, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t find your subject matter particularly engaging, but I applaud the creative take on the challenge topic. Rendering this in B&amp;W made this a much stronger photo. The stuff in the background is a little distracting, but the only thing that really needs to go is the corner of the blinds. Good use of DOF.</td>', 'I don''t find your subject matter particularly engaging, but I applaud the creative take on the challenge topic. Rendering this in B&W made this a much stronger photo. The stuff in the background is a little distracting, but the only thing that really needs to go is the corner of the blinds. Good use of DOF.', '2005-07-17 05:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540445, 201982, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the verticality of this shot; shooting from a lower angle might improve the composition. The placement of the "patriarch" in the frame seems a little odd; I''d have rather seen it dead center or closer to one of the edges.<br/> <br/>One thing that would have pushed this from a good photo to a ribbon contender is if you had made a triptych out of it. For example, imagine that you''re tethered to the smokestack and you''re walking around it taking pictures from the 1 o''clock position, then the 2 o''clock position, etc. Pick your favorite three of these photographs and create a tryptich from the results. Doing this wouldn''t make your submission meet the challenge any better, but I imagine that it''d still have enough of a kick to boost it''s score significantly.</td>', 'I like the verticality of this shot; shooting from a lower angle might improve the composition. The placement of the "patriarch" in the frame seems a little odd; I''d have rather seen it dead center or closer to one of the edges. One thing that would have pushed this from a good photo to a ribbon contender is if you had made a triptych out of it. For example, imagine that you''re tethered to the smokestack and you''re walking around it taking pictures from the 1 o''clock position, then the 2 o''clock position, etc. Pick your favorite three of these photographs and create a tryptich from the results. Doing this wouldn''t make your submission meet the challenge any better, but I imagine that it''d still have enough of a kick to boost it''s score significantly.', '2005-07-17 05:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540448, 201036, 10261, '<td valign="top"><br/>Something about the way that this was processed makes it look artificial; too much sharpening perhaps? The background is distracting, and the foreground seems to be dedicated to a well focused view of someone''s back. My favorite part of the image is the figure in the left edge of the frame who''s looking down at the table. A shot taken of this person from a lower angle and looking up slightly at them would have been much a stronger submission. As it stands there''s not a clear point of interest.</td>', 'Something about the way that this was processed makes it look artificial; too much sharpening perhaps? The background is distracting, and the foreground seems to be dedicated to a well focused view of someone''s back. My favorite part of the image is the figure in the left edge of the frame who''s looking down at the table. A shot taken of this person from a lower angle and looking up slightly at them would have been much a stronger submission. As it stands there''s not a clear point of interest.', '2005-07-17 05:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540449, 202044, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t have a clear point of interest.</td>', 'This image doesn''t have a clear point of interest.', '2005-07-17 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540450, 202179, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally care for the soft focus, but it works alright here; the fact that the bag is fairly sharp makes it look like the blur wasn''t intentional, which does detract from the shot. I''d have voted this higher if the girl''s frontal lobe hadn''t been sheared off by the edge of the frame.</td>', 'I don''t personally care for the soft focus, but it works alright here; the fact that the bag is fairly sharp makes it look like the blur wasn''t intentional, which does detract from the shot. I''d have voted this higher if the girl''s frontal lobe hadn''t been sheared off by the edge of the frame.', '2005-07-17 06:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540452, 202462, 10261, '<td valign="top">The people in this scene feel like visual accessories. Are the birds the intended subject? If the composition delineated a clear subject this image would be stronger.<br/></td>', 'The people in this scene feel like visual accessories. Are the birds the intended subject? If the composition delineated a clear subject this image would be stronger.', '2005-07-17 06:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540459, 202247, 10261, '<td valign="top">The baby seems disproportionately large relative to the other members of your proposed family. This is a very creative take on the challenge topic, and one of my top picks for a ribbon.</td>', 'The baby seems disproportionately large relative to the other members of your proposed family. This is a very creative take on the challenge topic, and one of my top picks for a ribbon.', '2005-07-17 06:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540460, 201277, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Although this would have better met the challenge topic if you''d have left more than a ghost in the image this is still one of my top picks for a ribbon.</td>', 'Nicely done. Although this would have better met the challenge topic if you''d have left more than a ghost in the image this is still one of my top picks for a ribbon.', '2005-07-17 06:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540468, 200982, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s gross ... therefore I love it!  Actually I like it for other reasons, too.  It''s very unusual, for one thing.  And the family resemblance is striking; all the kids have Dad''s eyes.  8</td>', 'It''s gross ... therefore I love it!  Actually I like it for other reasons, too.  It''s very unusual, for one thing.  And the family resemblance is striking; all the kids have Dad''s eyes.  8', '2005-07-17 07:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540469, 202444, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait ... great subject, clever prop, very effective &amp; original pose.  It also gives a very clear and appealing view of the subject''s character.  8</td>', 'Terrific portrait ... great subject, clever prop, very effective & original pose.  It also gives a very clear and appealing view of the subject''s character.  8', '2005-07-17 07:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540470, 202286, 30364, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and well executed.  I like the fact that it doesn''t look set up ... a bit of background clutter, one toothbrush leaning a bit sideways ... makes it seem a more intimate "family" portrait, and therefore more appealing.  7</td>', 'Clever idea and well executed.  I like the fact that it doesn''t look set up ... a bit of background clutter, one toothbrush leaning a bit sideways ... makes it seem a more intimate "family" portrait, and therefore more appealing.  7', '2005-07-17 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540471, 201923, 25355, '<td valign="top">Possibly somewhere in Iceland...</td>', 'Possibly somewhere in Iceland...', '2005-07-17 07:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540472, 202488, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of "staged" shots, but it''s hard not to like this ... I even like the cheesy shirts.  Kitsch, but in a good way.  6</td>', 'I''m not a fan of "staged" shots, but it''s hard not to like this ... I even like the cheesy shirts.  Kitsch, but in a good way.  6', '2005-07-17 07:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540475, 202358, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s nearly a good idea, but  just not quite interesting enough for me.  It''s a good photograph as well, but  just a bit lifeless (I don''t mean that as a bad joke; I mean that my first reaction is to think about the furniture, rather than the family.)   I nevertheless applaud your thinking outside the square.  5<br/>Further explanation:  A couple of other entries use shoes and toothbrushes in the same way you''ve used table places, and I think succeed a bit better because those items are more intimate &amp; personal ... the table setting seems just a little sterile.</td>', 'It''s nearly a good idea, but  just not quite interesting enough for me.  It''s a good photograph as well, but  just a bit lifeless (I don''t mean that as a bad joke; I mean that my first reaction is to think about the furniture, rather than the family.)   I nevertheless applaud your thinking outside the square.  5Further explanation:  A couple of other entries use shoes and toothbrushes in the same way you''ve used table places, and I think succeed a bit better because those items are more intimate & personal ... the table setting seems just a little sterile.', '2005-07-17 07:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540480, 201515, 30364, '<td valign="top">Charming portrait; I like the loving smiles, but it''s the shoes, the bag and the umbrella that really make this image.  First glance ... a good, candid family portrait.  But look a few moments longer &amp;  you appreciate that this is a very clever, subtle work of high quality.  I hope the voters give you the few extra seconds consideration that you deserve!  9</td>', 'Charming portrait; I like the loving smiles, but it''s the shoes, the bag and the umbrella that really make this image.  First glance ... a good, candid family portrait.  But look a few moments longer &  you appreciate that this is a very clever, subtle work of high quality.  I hope the voters give you the few extra seconds consideration that you deserve!  9', '2005-07-17 07:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540491, 201612, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very unusual &amp; compelling portrait, if a bit Gothic.  What I like most about it is that it''s interesting ... the photographer is challenging the viewer to think about this image.  And the image justifies the effort.  That should be encouraged; less pretty pictures &amp; more thinking!  Well done.  Keep doing it. 9</td>', 'A very unusual & compelling portrait, if a bit Gothic.  What I like most about it is that it''s interesting ... the photographer is challenging the viewer to think about this image.  And the image justifies the effort.  That should be encouraged; less pretty pictures & more thinking!  Well done.  Keep doing it. 9', '2005-07-17 08:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540495, 201655, 30364, '<td valign="top">You''ve nailed the title with this image (&amp; vice-versa).  The expression in little sister''s eye says total trust to me.  Well done.  7</td>', 'You''ve nailed the title with this image (& vice-versa).  The expression in little sister''s eye says total trust to me.  Well done.  7', '2005-07-17 08:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540497, 200826, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Well done for thinking outside the square.  It''s a good photograph as well.  7</td>', 'Good idea.  Well done for thinking outside the square.  It''s a good photograph as well.  7', '2005-07-17 08:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540500, 201805, 30364, '<td valign="top">Unusual composition, but effective and appealing.  I also like the bold cropping (or framing, if you didn''t crop it).  7</td>', 'Unusual composition, but effective and appealing.  I also like the bold cropping (or framing, if you didn''t crop it).  7', '2005-07-17 08:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540506, 200267, 30364, '<td valign="top">That is a great family photograph.  I''d love to know what this guy has just said (or done) to earn this  80% disapproval rating from the other family members.  Whatever it was, he''s marvellously unrepentant.  He doesn''t even care about the selective desaturation (and nor do I).  Terrific work.  8</td>', 'That is a great family photograph.  I''d love to know what this guy has just said (or done) to earn this  80% disapproval rating from the other family members.  Whatever it was, he''s marvellously unrepentant.  He doesn''t even care about the selective desaturation (and nor do I).  Terrific work.  8', '2005-07-17 08:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540668, 202399, 164, '<td valign="top">Glow around the Babies head seems distracting. Otherwise good color and composition</td>', 'Glow around the Babies head seems distracting. Otherwise good color and composition', '2005-07-17 10:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540669, 200794, 164, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge Just not to my liking.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge Just not to my liking.', '2005-07-17 10:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540671, 202404, 164, '<td valign="top">I am not sure of the reasoning for the angle.</td>', 'I am not sure of the reasoning for the angle.', '2005-07-17 10:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540674, 200770, 37961, '<td valign="top">Touching.</td>', 'Touching.', '2005-07-17 10:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540675, 202108, 37961, '<td valign="top">Apes are certainly very family oriented. So sweet with their babies. This photo is very well captured. I think I have seen other ape photos on this site. You must have a nice zoo close to you. I wonder if your the same person with the other good ape photos?<br/></td>', 'Apes are certainly very family oriented. So sweet with their babies. This photo is very well captured. I think I have seen other ape photos on this site. You must have a nice zoo close to you. I wonder if your the same person with the other good ape photos?', '2005-07-17 10:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540677, 202421, 37851, '<td valign="top">Captues a great nostalgic mood</td>', 'Captues a great nostalgic mood', '2005-07-17 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540678, 202454, 37851, '<td valign="top">Not in my house!  Great capture.</td>', 'Not in my house!  Great capture.', '2005-07-17 10:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540679, 202348, 37851, '<td valign="top">Very emotional.  Wonderful concept.</td>', 'Very emotional.  Wonderful concept.', '2005-07-17 10:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540680, 200291, 37851, '<td valign="top">That is family.  Perfect capture for this challange.</td>', 'That is family.  Perfect capture for this challange.', '2005-07-17 10:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540681, 201369, 37851, '<td valign="top">Rather  staged, but very sweet.</td>', 'Rather  staged, but very sweet.', '2005-07-17 10:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540682, 202391, 37851, '<td valign="top">Very posed, but a nice clear shot.</td>', 'Very posed, but a nice clear shot.', '2005-07-17 10:09:44.000000', NULL, 1);
