(1541895, 202064, 1031, '<td valign="top">From this far away, it''s hard to see any detail or identify the kids anyway; against the tree, I find them a bit hard to see at all.<br/>I don''t know that the geography''s like over to the right, but if it''s a clear view of the water, I think I''d try moving left and shooting them in silhouette against the water and sky. I have a recent shot of some people on a rollercoaster against a so-so sunset and it seemed to work pretty well.</td>', 'From this far away, it''s hard to see any detail or identify the kids anyway; against the tree, I find them a bit hard to see at all.I don''t know that the geography''s like over to the right, but if it''s a clear view of the water, I think I''d try moving left and shooting them in silhouette against the water and sky. I have a recent shot of some people on a rollercoaster against a so-so sunset and it seemed to work pretty well.', '2005-07-17 22:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
