(1542038, 202331, 1031, '<td valign="top">Since this was an Advanced editing challenge, I''d have strongly considered making a couple of masks and blutting the far background quite a bit, and the tree somewhat less so, to create both a feeling of depth and to provide a less-distracting BG for the portrait., and cloning out/burinign in what looks like a bright reflection on her lip. This would somewhat simulate the effect of opening the aperture to a very wide setting--not possible with all cameras or under all conditions though.<br/>Pose and lighting/tones in the portrait are wonderful.</td>', 'Since this was an Advanced editing challenge, I''d have strongly considered making a couple of masks and blutting the far background quite a bit, and the tree somewhat less so, to create both a feeling of depth and to provide a less-distracting BG for the portrait., and cloning out/burinign in what looks like a bright reflection on her lip. This would somewhat simulate the effect of opening the aperture to a very wide setting--not possible with all cameras or under all conditions though.Pose and lighting/tones in the portrait are wonderful.', '2005-07-17 23:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
