(1542145, 202353, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  Good out of the box thinking.  Some dollhouse home furniture and a small living room would have made this a real hoot, but it works in concept as is.  How do you get the lighting to work?  Wiring on the back side?</td>', 'Return for comment.  Good out of the box thinking.  Some dollhouse home furniture and a small living room would have made this a real hoot, but it works in concept as is.  How do you get the lighting to work?  Wiring on the back side?', '2005-07-18 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
