(1542909, 200770, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.<br/> <br/>That being said, you will resonate with it because of the context. It is personal to you. You have a lifetime to build context. I do not. Max, I gave this image 3.4 seconds. Unfair? Certainly!<br/> <br/>Make it personal for me and I''ll give you 30 more seconds and a better score.<br/> <br/>Sorry to be direct. I do not mean to be hurtfull.</td>', 'I like this very much. That being said, you will resonate with it because of the context. It is personal to you. You have a lifetime to build context. I do not. Max, I gave this image 3.4 seconds. Unfair? Certainly! Make it personal for me and I''ll give you 30 more seconds and a better score. Sorry to be direct. I do not mean to be hurtfull.', '2005-07-18 04:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
