(1543153, 201854, 255, '<td valign="top">weird. i spend almost everyday with my 4 year old nephew--whether at the beach or the pool (this scene reminds me of our sunspree, where we like to pretend we are on vacation)--and that''s exactly what this photo reminded me of--his mom and/or i trying to chill poolside, while the little rascal hops all over us, wanting to play...cause, um, he''s a kid. it wasn''t until i read your comment--then the rest of them--that i even noticed anything untoward about this shot. people amaze me sometimes.</td>', 'weird. i spend almost everyday with my 4 year old nephew--whether at the beach or the pool (this scene reminds me of our sunspree, where we like to pretend we are on vacation)--and that''s exactly what this photo reminded me of--his mom and/or i trying to chill poolside, while the little rascal hops all over us, wanting to play...cause, um, he''s a kid. it wasn''t until i read your comment--then the rest of them--that i even noticed anything untoward about this shot. people amaze me sometimes.', '2005-07-18 08:27:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1543173, 202399, 27812, '<td valign="top">Robt,<br/>Wonderful pic with so much hidden feelings. Wish it ended higher. You are just a great man, a very talented person to ''see'' these pics. Well done my friend.</td>', 'Robt,Wonderful pic with so much hidden feelings. Wish it ended higher. You are just a great man, a very talented person to ''see'' these pics. Well done my friend.', '2005-07-18 08:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
