(1543302, 200770, 22872, '<td valign="top">You had much more guts than I ever would of had.  When my brother died I was afraid to touch him...could not do it.  Hell after I saw him in the morgue I had horrible nightmares for several nights.  Too many scary movies or something more subconscious...who knows.  I applaud in having the courage to do this, especially during such a heartwrenching time.</td>', 'You had much more guts than I ever would of had.  When my brother died I was afraid to touch him...could not do it.  Hell after I saw him in the morgue I had horrible nightmares for several nights.  Too many scary movies or something more subconscious...who knows.  I applaud in having the courage to do this, especially during such a heartwrenching time.', '2005-07-18 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1543306, 202108, 4482, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot! Love the Orangs!!</td>', 'Very cool shot! Love the Orangs!!', '2005-07-18 09:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
