(1543323, 200982, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent - really unusual and full of colour and interest, despite a subject that most will find abhorrrent. Never let that put you off, because life is dull without exploring worlds outside of our comfort zone.</td>', 'Excellent - really unusual and full of colour and interest, despite a subject that most will find abhorrrent. Never let that put you off, because life is dull without exploring worlds outside of our comfort zone.', '2005-07-18 09:54:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1543339, 200982, 20530, '<td valign="top">Wow! Can''t believe this is my highest score yet!<br/> <br/>Thanks, everyone for the great comments and votes. They were better than I expected.  Comments reflected exactly how I felt about this image. I hoped for more focus and a less busy composition. But of all the shots I took, this was the best. I''ll post some outtakes that are even creepier than this one.</td>', 'Wow! Can''t believe this is my highest score yet! Thanks, everyone for the great comments and votes. They were better than I expected.  Comments reflected exactly how I felt about this image. I hoped for more focus and a less busy composition. But of all the shots I took, this was the best. I''ll post some outtakes that are even creepier than this one.', '2005-07-18 10:02:12.000000', NULL, 0),
