(1543404, 201854, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you have anything to apologize for either. Your idea was clearly captured. Everything about the photo indicates you were trying to portray the woman as an object. Most adults see a pretty body and think of sex. The little guy doesn''t see that at all. He sees the object that feeds him and is his buddy, his own personal toy that responds to his every wish. I thought this was one of the best ones in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t think you have anything to apologize for either. Your idea was clearly captured. Everything about the photo indicates you were trying to portray the woman as an object. Most adults see a pretty body and think of sex. The little guy doesn''t see that at all. He sees the object that feeds him and is his buddy, his own personal toy that responds to his every wish. I thought this was one of the best ones in the challenge.', '2005-07-18 10:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1543409, 202108, 26464, '<td valign="top">congrats on your first ribbon. i''ve been watching your stuff for a while and it was just a matter of time before you got one. <br/></td>', 'congrats on your first ribbon. i''ve been watching your stuff for a while and it was just a matter of time before you got one. ', '2005-07-18 10:39:31.000000', NULL, 0),
