(1543585, 200764, 36173, '<td valign="top">Ok, I confess... this photo was taken for the circle challenge, but when I went to enter it, it had already ended (which I don''t understand because it was still the date the challenge was supposed to end). I gave it the "family circle" name and entered it so I could receive some feedback on the photo itself, which I have received many helpful comments. Thank you to everyone who gave me advice (other than the obvious "I don''t get the relation to the family theme").<br/>I am new at this (only 2nd entry) so I appreciate the helpful feedback. <br/>Now to those who wanted to know what it is. It is a glass vase turned on its side. The blue background is actually a step for one of my workout videos with a light behind it. I had fun with this and will continue to enter... I am determined to make it to somewhere other than the bottom 10 :)<br/></td>', 'Ok, I confess... this photo was taken for the circle challenge, but when I went to enter it, it had already ended (which I don''t understand because it was still the date the challenge was supposed to end). I gave it the "family circle" name and entered it so I could receive some feedback on the photo itself, which I have received many helpful comments. Thank you to everyone who gave me advice (other than the obvious "I don''t get the relation to the family theme").I am new at this (only 2nd entry) so I appreciate the helpful feedback. Now to those who wanted to know what it is. It is a glass vase turned on its side. The blue background is actually a step for one of my workout videos with a light behind it. I had fun with this and will continue to enter... I am determined to make it to somewhere other than the bottom 10 :)', '2005-07-18 11:42:49.000000', NULL, 0),
