(1545627, 202210, 3669, '<td valign="top">Thank-you to EVERYONE for your comments and praise.  This is my highest rated photo on DPC.  I have never been in the top 10 before and I am very happy about that.  Not too shabby for still using a 2 MP point and shoot.  Hopefully soon, I''ll be able to upgrade.<br/> <br/>I have re-done this photo and submitted to DPC Prints but i have quite a hurdle to overcome due to my low resolution camera in providing a good quality print.  We''ll have to see if it will be approved.<br/> <br/>As for the bunnies?  They are growing like weeds.  Anyone in the Billings, Montana area want one of these cute bunnies?  You can go to <a href="//www.verlannahill.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">www.verlannahill.com</a> for more information on our rabbitry.</td>', 'Thank-you to EVERYONE for your comments and praise.  This is my highest rated photo on DPC.  I have never been in the top 10 before and I am very happy about that.  Not too shabby for still using a 2 MP point and shoot.  Hopefully soon, I''ll be able to upgrade. I have re-done this photo and submitted to DPC Prints but i have quite a hurdle to overcome due to my low resolution camera in providing a good quality print.  We''ll have to see if it will be approved. As for the bunnies?  They are growing like weeds.  Anyone in the Billings, Montana area want one of these cute bunnies?  You can go to www.verlannahill.com for more information on our rabbitry.', '2005-07-19 06:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
