(1547554, 200542, 714, '<td valign="top">The title is what throws everyone off here.  I see her hanging on something.  I don''t see her dancing.  Nice shot though...lucky you did as well as you did.</td>', 'The title is what throws everyone off here.  I see her hanging on something.  I don''t see her dancing.  Nice shot though...lucky you did as well as you did.', '2005-07-19 20:33:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1547572, 202348, 93, '<td valign="top">I agree with some of the commenters that this could have used a touch more contrast.. and maybe not so strong a yellow cast in your sepia toning.  However, it''s a very touching photograph, literally and figuratively :)</td>', 'I agree with some of the commenters that this could have used a touch more contrast.. and maybe not so strong a yellow cast in your sepia toning.  However, it''s a very touching photograph, literally and figuratively :)', '2005-07-19 20:41:24.000000', NULL, 0),
