(1547828, 202454, 93, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve run across this breed of cat before. This is a wonderful pet portait. So relaxing and serene.  I''d dodge up the eye on the viewer''s right there a bit to get it more matching the other one, the murkiness of it gives for a little bit of a strange look, although that might be purposeful, or more accurate. I don''t know. Removing the papers would have been nice too, leaving the lemons and brown tones for background.</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve run across this breed of cat before. This is a wonderful pet portait. So relaxing and serene.  I''d dodge up the eye on the viewer''s right there a bit to get it more matching the other one, the murkiness of it gives for a little bit of a strange look, although that might be purposeful, or more accurate. I don''t know. Removing the papers would have been nice too, leaving the lemons and brown tones for background.', '2005-07-19 22:36:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1548081, 201697, 32607, '<td valign="top">Great shot - were they just goofing around in front of a black backdrop?  Whenever I try to photograph my two guys in front of a backdrop one is always on the move or they are too far apart from eachother and I have to "cut out" some of the extra space.  Too bad the right side is a bit blurry - otherwise perfect!</td>', 'Great shot - were they just goofing around in front of a black backdrop?  Whenever I try to photograph my two guys in front of a backdrop one is always on the move or they are too far apart from eachother and I have to "cut out" some of the extra space.  Too bad the right side is a bit blurry - otherwise perfect!', '2005-07-20 00:00:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1548755, 201690, 15266, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much to all who viewed and commented on this shot.  It IS my 2 daughters and yes, I posed them, but in a position that they knew all too well as you can see.  It was like asking them to breath!   They love being Mom''s models, I''m sure you will see them again.</td>', 'Thanks so much to all who viewed and commented on this shot.  It IS my 2 daughters and yes, I posed them, but in a position that they knew all too well as you can see.  It was like asking them to breath!   They love being Mom''s models, I''m sure you will see them again.', '2005-07-20 02:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549088, 202261, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well done, congratulations!</td>', 'Well done, congratulations!', '2005-07-20 03:31:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549421, 201772, 36231, '<td valign="top">Amber - I have to agree with the "post challenge" posts.  In no way does this photo deserve less than a 4.  In no way does it derserve less than a 5!  That''s just crazy!  I took one look at it, and totally understood.  For someone to actually write "roots and family don''t tie", you''d think they''d get it as they were typing it! <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.  I love to just stare at this photo, and think about the symbolism of it.  I know I''m no "expert", but I know what I like what I like. :)</td>', 'Amber - I have to agree with the "post challenge" posts.  In no way does this photo deserve less than a 4.  In no way does it derserve less than a 5!  That''s just crazy!  I took one look at it, and totally understood.  For someone to actually write "roots and family don''t tie", you''d think they''d get it as they were typing it!  Keep up the good work.  I love to just stare at this photo, and think about the symbolism of it.  I know I''m no "expert", but I know what I like what I like. :)', '2005-07-20 08:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549434, 202306, 36231, '<td valign="top">I get so much from this photo.  Not only does the bottle say "Family Vineyards", it also says to me, "Family is coming over, grab the wine. I need it!"  That''s how I feel with my  in-laws sometimes. :)<br/> <br/>As far as the photo, it would have been nice for there to be more light on the bottle.  The DOF is nice, I like the background blurred, but not too much.  I just would have liked to see the bottle stand out more against the background.<br/> <br/>Good job.  Keep up the good work, and don''t let them get you down! :)</td>', 'I get so much from this photo.  Not only does the bottle say "Family Vineyards", it also says to me, "Family is coming over, grab the wine. I need it!"  That''s how I feel with my  in-laws sometimes. :) As far as the photo, it would have been nice for there to be more light on the bottle.  The DOF is nice, I like the background blurred, but not too much.  I just would have liked to see the bottle stand out more against the background. Good job.  Keep up the good work, and don''t let them get you down! :)', '2005-07-20 08:28:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1549436, 200764, 36231, '<td valign="top">You know ... I wondered ... :)</td>', 'You know ... I wondered ... :)', '2005-07-20 08:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
