(1550840, 200542, 13749, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I really liked this when I saw it in the challenge.  Great job - of course, the connection wasn''t the most obvious.. but it certainly did okay even w/o the relevance smacking us across the face.  Composition, color, texture, model, etc.. all are great.</td>', 'Very nice - I really liked this when I saw it in the challenge.  Great job - of course, the connection wasn''t the most obvious.. but it certainly did okay even w/o the relevance smacking us across the face.  Composition, color, texture, model, etc.. all are great.', '2005-07-20 16:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1551193, 202413, 22781, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, I was just thinking. What is Steinar doing. So I went to your profile and was amazed you scored even lower then me :)<br/>My entry also was a "Yes, I''m still here" entry...<br/> <br/>Poor kid.... Hope it didn''t hurt...</td>', 'Hahaha, I was just thinking. What is Steinar doing. So I went to your profile and was amazed you scored even lower then me :)My entry also was a "Yes, I''m still here" entry... Poor kid.... Hope it didn''t hurt...', '2005-07-20 19:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
