(1575230, 202329, 25397, '<td valign="top">Nice yard, when I grow up and have a home I''m going to plan dandelions everywhere because I like them. I hope they spread to my neighbours lawn and then they get mad. I will then paint my house in a rainbow of different colors but put hidden messages in it only I can find and chuckle to myself about.<br/>Oh yes, your picture...<br/>Ever try a tritone? I can see this as a nice goldeny or even pinkish one, it would give it more of an edge over normal black and white. I also would like to see the little girls not so center, if they were more to the side then they would have better impact and pop out more against such a huge field of lovely overgrowness.</td>', 'Nice yard, when I grow up and have a home I''m going to plan dandelions everywhere because I like them. I hope they spread to my neighbours lawn and then they get mad. I will then paint my house in a rainbow of different colors but put hidden messages in it only I can find and chuckle to myself about.Oh yes, your picture...Ever try a tritone? I can see this as a nice goldeny or even pinkish one, it would give it more of an edge over normal black and white. I also would like to see the little girls not so center, if they were more to the side then they would have better impact and pop out more against such a huge field of lovely overgrowness.', '2005-07-31 01:25:17.000000', NULL, 0),
